<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">Diuteronomi</book>
  <para style="h">Diuteronomi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Diuteronomi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Diuteronomi</para>
  <para style="mt">Diuteronomi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiai thute Jordan suahlam gamdai, Paran leh Tophel leh Laban leh Hazeroth leh Dizahab kikal a Suph chin a Arabah a Mosi in Israel mi tengteng kiang a a gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Horeb tang a kipan Kadesh-barnea, Seir tanglam lampi tawn a pai in ni sawmlehkhat lam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum sawmlina, kha sawmlehkhatna, huai kha ni khat ni’n, hichi ahi a, Toupa’n amau hilh dia thu a piak tengteng Israel suante kiang ah Mosi in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Heshbon a om Amorte kumpipa Sihon leh Edre-i leh Astaroth a om Bashan kumpipa Og a thah nung in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jordan suahlam Moab gam ah hiai dan Mosi in hiai bang in a genchian panta hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa i Pathian un Horeb tang ah a hon houpih a, “Hiai tang ah na om sawt huntawkta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kisuan unla, paikhia unla, Amorte tanggam ah leh a kimvel teng Arabah ah, tanggamte ah, phaizang gam leh Lebanon ah, Luipi Euphrates tan in pai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai un, gam k’on pekhin a; na pu uh Abraham, Isak, Jakob leh amau nung a, a suansawnte uh kiang a kichiam a Toupa’n a piak gam valuah un,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huailai in na kiang uah, “Kei kia in k’on paw zoukei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a hon pungsak a, ngai un, tuin na tam dan uh van a aksi zah hial a hong hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa , na pi leh pute Pathian in tu sang a mun sang tamtakin hon pungsak henla, a honchiam bang in hon vualzawl hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangchi’n kei kia in na buainate uh, na puakgikte uh, na kihou theihlouhnate uh ka pawzou dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na nam lak ua mi, mi pil, theisiam mi, a dan ding theimi kitelkhia unla, na tung ua heutu ding in ka bawl ding” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nou, “Na thil gen kou adin a hoih mahmah” chi in n’on dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in na nam heutute uh ka la a, na nam lak ua mi, mi pil a dantheimite na tung ua heutu in ka bawl hi: sangte tung a heutute, zate tung a heutute, sawmngate tung a heutute, sawmte tung a heutute, intek pente toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huailai in na vaihawmmite uh kiang ah, “Na unaute uh kal a thu ngaihkhiak sak unla, unau leh unau kikal ah leh gamdang mi, a ompih toh a kal uah diktattak in vaihawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vaihawmna ah deihsaktuam na nei ding uh ahi kei. Mi neu leh mi lian kibang a na ngaihkhiak sak ding uh ahi. Kuamah na lau ding uh ahi kei. Vaihawmna lah Pathian a ahi ngal a. Nou adia thu haksa luate ka kiang ah na hontun zel ding ua, huai ka ngaikhe zel ding” chi in thu ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huailai in na thilhih ding tengteng uah thu k’on pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa’n thu honpiak bang in Horeb tang apan i pawt ua, Amorte tanggam lampi a gamdai zapi leh mulkimhuaitak na muh uh i kantan ua, Kadesh-barnea khua i va tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na kiang uah, “ Toupa i Pathian in a honpiak Amorte tanggam na hongtungta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngai dih ua, Toupa na Pathian un gam a hon pekhinta hi. Hoh tou unla, Toupa na pi leh pute Pathian in a na genkhitsa bang in va luahtou un. Lau kei unla, lunglel sam kei un” k’on chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka kiang ah na hongpai vek ua, “A gam va enkhia a, i hoh touhna ding lampi leh i hohna ding khaw tanchinte honghilh nawn di’n i ma uah mi sawl leng” na chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huai thu in a hon kipaksak a; Huchi in na lak ua mi sawmlehnih, nam khat a khat zel ka tel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in a pawtta ua, tang ah a kahtou ua, Eskol guam a va tung ua, a va enkhe vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huai gam a theite a lou ua, a honpuak ua, tanchin a hontun ua; “ Toupa i Pathian hon gam piak hoih petmah ahi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Himahleh na hohtou nuam kei ua, Toupa na Pathian uh thupiak na helsan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na puaninte uah na phun ua, “ Toupa’n a honhuat ziak in hon hihmang dia, Amorte khut a honpe ding in Aigupta gam apan hon pikhia ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Koilai ah ahia i hohtouh ding? I unaute’n, mihing ei sang in a lianzaw ua, san leng a sangzaw ua; khuate a lian a, vansun in kulh a nei uh. Anak tate leng i mu a, chi in a hon lung kesak uh” na chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ke’n na kiang uah, “Amaute kihta kei unla, lau leng lau sam kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian na makaipa un na mitmuh ua Aigupta gam a a hon hihsak tengteng bang in a hon doupih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gamdai ah leng mi’n a ta a puak bang a Toupa na Pathian un hiai mun na tun tan un lamtawn a a hon puakdan na mu ding uhi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Himahleh hiai thil ah Toupa na Pathian uh na gingta kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na puanin na zak ding uh hon zonsak ding leh na lampi uh hon kawkmuh dia zan a mei a, sun a meipi a na ma uh pipa na muang kei uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Toupa’n na thugen uh a za a, a heh a, a kichiam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Hiai suan gilou tak lak a mi khat mahmah in leng na pi leh pute uh pedia ka kichiamna gam hoih petmah a mu kei ding uh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jephunneh tapa Kaleb kia ngallou in. Aman zaw a mu dia, a vasik gam amah leh a tate ka pe ding, aman Toupa a lungtang tengteng a a zuih ziak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Noute ziak in ka tung ah Toupa a heh a, “Nang leng huai ah na lut kei ding,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Na nasempa Nun tapa Joshua bel a lut ding. Amah hanthawn in, Israelte a lutsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Na ta neute uh, gallak in a lamai ding uh, na chihte uleh, tua a sia a pha thei nailou na tate uh a lut ding ua, amau zaw ka pedia, a luah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nou ahihleh kihei unla, Tuipi San lam ah gamdai ah pai un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Nou “ Toupa tung ah i na khialta uhi, i hohtou ding ua, Toupa i Pathian in thu a honpiak tengteng bang in i vadou ding uh” chi in n’on dawng ua, huchi in kidouna van in na kivan chiat ua, tang a hohtouh thil neuchik in na ngaihtuah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah, “Hoh tou kei un. Vadou sam kei un, na lak uah ka omkei hi. Na melmate un a hon na that kha ding uh, a kiang uah chi in” a honchi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Huai k’on hilh a, na ngaikhe kei ua, Toupa thupiak na helsan zawta ua, tang ah na hohtou teitei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Huai tang ah Amorte’n a hon na dou ua, khuai midelh bang in a hon delh ua, Seir apan Hormah tan in a honthat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Na hong kiknawn ua, Toupa ma ah na kap ua; himahleh Toupa’n na aw uh a ngaikhe kei a, a bil leng a hondoh sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Huchi in huai a na omsung uh ngaihtuah in Kadesh ah sawtpi na tam uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, i kihei ua, Toupa’n i kiang ua a gen bang in Tuipi San lam ah gamdai ah i lutta ua; Seir tang ni tampi i vel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n a hon houpih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Hiai tang na vel sawt hunta uh. Mallam zuan in kihei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mipite, Seir tang a om, Esau suan na unaute uh gam ah na paisuak ding uhi. Amau a hon na lau ding ua; huaiziak in pilvang mahmah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kisual pih kei un. A gam uh koilai mah leng, khepek a sik khop lel leng nou k’on pekei ding. Seir tang zaw a ma a tuam di’n Esau ka pekhinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na nek ding un a an uh sum in na lei ding ua, na dawn ding un a tui uh leng sum in na lei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un na khut nasep peuhmah uah a hon vualzawl zel a, hiai gamdai zapi na totsuak dante uh leng a thei hi. Hiai kum sawmli sungteng in Toupa na kiang uah a om a, bangmah na tasam kei uhi, chi’n thupia in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in Elat leh Ezion-geber apan Arba lam a pai in Seir tang a om Esau suan i unaute gam i tawn paisuak uhi. I kihei ua, Moab gamdai lam ah i pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah, “Moabte hihbuai kei unla, galsual in leng sual kei un. A gam uh nou a tuam ding in k’on pe kei ding, Lot suante a tuam di’n Ar ka pekhinta hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuma lam in Eminte, huai ah a teng ua, amaute Anakimte bang a milian leh tam, mi sangpite ahi uh .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaite leng Anakimte mah bang a miliante ahi ua, himahleh Maobte’n Emimte a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuma lam in Seir tang ah Horte leng a om ua; himahleh Esau suante’n a luahsak uhi. A that ua, a mun uah a tengta ua; Israelte Toupa’n amau a tuam dia a piak gam mah bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in, “Thou unla, Zered phaizang kandih ua” a chi a; Huchi in Zered phaizang i kanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kadesh-barnea apan i pawt a, Zered phaizang i kan ua, Toupa’n a kiang ua a kichiam bang a mipi lak a misuan a galdouthei mi tengteng a beivek kikal uh kum sawmthum leh giat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mipite lak apan a bei sipsip ma uh amaute hihmang di’n Toupa khut a tung uah a tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi ahi a, huchibang a mipi lak apan galdou thei tengteng a bei ua, a hong sihkhit nung un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa’n a hon houpih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tuni in Moab gam, Ar na khen paisuak ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ammon suante kiang a va tun chiang un, hihbuai kei unla, kisual pih kei un. Ammonte gam nang a tuam ding in k’on pe kei ding. Lot suante a tuam di’n ka pekhinta” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huai leng Rephaimte gam bang a sim ahi sam; huai ah tuma lam in Rephaimte a teng uhi. Himahleh Ammonte’n zaw Zamzummim a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anakte bang a mi lian leh tam leh mi sang pipi ahi ua; himahleh Toupa’n a hihmang a, amau a luah leuleu ua, a mun uah a tengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Seir tang a om Esau suante Horte a hihman saklai a, a hih bang in; Huchi in amau a luah ua, a mun uah tu dong in a tenglai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gaza tan a khoneu chikchik a om Avite Kaptor apan a hongpawt Kaptorte’n a hihmang ua, a mun uah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Thou unla, paikhia unla, Arnon guam kan un; ngai dih ua, Amormi Heshbon kumpipa Sihon leh a gam k’on pekhinta hi; luah peuhmah unla, galsual in sual un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuni in, van nuai a namchih tung ah nang hon lauhna uh leh hon kihtakna uh ka omsak pan dia, na tanchin a za ding ua, a ling ding ua nang ziak in gimthuak in a om ding uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kedemoth gamdai apan Heshbon kumpipa Sihon kiang ah lemna thu pua in mi ka sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Na gam ah hon paisuaksak dihve. Lamlian zel ah ka pai ding ua, a taklam ah hiam, a veilam ah hiam leng ka pial kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka nek ding un an sum in n’on lei sak dia, ka dawn ding un tui leng sum mah in n’on leisak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jordan ka kan ua Toupa ka Pathian un a honpiak gam ka lut masiah uh, Seir a om Esau suante leh Ar a om Moabte’n a hon paisuaksak bang un hon paisuak saklel in” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Himahleh Heshbon kumpipa Sihon in a gam ah a hon paisuaksak nuam kei a; Toupa na Pathian un na khut ua a honpiak theihna ding in a lungtang a khauhsak a, na theihsa uh bang un a paupeng sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah, “Ngai in, Sihon leh a gam honpe ding ka hita, a gam tang ding in luah peuhmah in” a honchi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sihon leh a mi tengteng Jahaz a hongsual di’n a hong kuan uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Toupa i Pathian in a honpia a; amah leh a tate leh a mite tengteng i that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Huailai in a khua tengteng i la ua, huai khuate a mihing tengteng, numei leh a ta neu chikchikte uh tan in i hihmang vek ua, hawi mahmah i neikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />I lak khua a gallak a i lak thil leh gante kia ei a tuam ding in i la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Arnon guam a om Aroer apan leh guam a khaw om apan Gilead pha in ei adin khua sang lua a omkei hi, Toupa i Pathian in a hon pevek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Toupa’n thu a honpiak bang in Ammon suante gam koimah, Jabok lui tan in mualtung a khuate kim leh kiang gam hitaleh na naih kei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huaikhit in i kihei ua, Bashan lampi ah i paitou uhi. Bashan kumpipa Og leh a mi tengteng Edre-i ah ei dou ding in a hong kuan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah, “Amah lau ke’n, amah leh a mi tengteng leh a gam na khut ah k’on pekhinta hi. Heshbon a om Amorte kumpipa Sihon tung a na hih bang in amah tung ah na hih ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa i Pathian in Bashan kumpipa Og leng, a mi tengteng toh i khut ah a honpia hi. Huchi in khat lel leng hawilou in i that vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huailai in a khua tengteng khaw sawmguk, Argob gambup a Bashan kumpipa Og gam tengteng i la vek ua, i lak saklouh khua khat lel leng a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hiai khua tengteng kulh sang pipi, kongpi leh kalhna neichiat ahi a, kulh neilou khua tampi simlouh in leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Heshbon kumpipa Sihon tung a i hih bang in khua a pasal tengteng, numei leh a ta neu chikchikte uh tan in i hihmang sipsip uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh gan tengteng leh khua a gallak a i lak thilte ei a tuam ding in i la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huailai in Jordan gal a om Amorte kumpipa nihte apan Arnon guam apan Hermon tang pha in gam i la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hermon Jidonte’n Sirion a chi ua, Amorte’n Senir a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Phaigam a khua tengteng leh Gilead gam tengteng leh Bashan gam tengteng toh, Bashan gam a Og gam a khuate, Salek leh Enderi tan in i la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Milian a sibangte lak a a khosuak sun Bashan kumpipa Og kia ahi a, ngai dih, a lupna sik ahi a; Ammon suante khua Rabath ah tutan in a om ahi kei maw? Huai lupna mihing tong a teh in a dunglam tong kua, a vailam tong li ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huai tung in huai gam i luah ua; Arnon guam kiang Aroer apan Gilead tanggam kimkhat tan in, khua omte toh Reubente leh Gadte ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gilead gam omlai teng leh Og gam Bashan tengteng Manasseh nam kimkhatte ka pia hi, Argob gam tengteng leh Bashan gam tengteng Rephaimte gamchih in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Manasseh tapa Jair in Argob gam tengteng Geshurte leh Makatte gam tan in a la a, Bashan pen, amah min tam in Havothjair a sa a, tunitan in a chilai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gilead kiang ah Makir ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Reubente leh Gadte bel Gilead apan Arnon guam, guam laitak tan in a gam ding un ka pia a; Ammon suante gamgi, Jabok lui tan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A tumlam gamgi Arabah a Jordan lui, Kinereth apan Arabah Tuipi tan, Pisgah mualpang ken nuai a pai ahi. Arabah Tuipi, Chi Tuipi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huailai in, Toupa na Pathian un “Hiai gam nou a tuam ding in a honpia hi. Israelte, na unaute uh ma ah na mihangsan tengteng uh kigalvan in va hohtou sam uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himahleh, na zite uh leh na ta neu chikchikte uh leh na gante uh, gan na hau uh chih ka thei, na khua uah, k’on piaksa ah a na om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nou bang a na unaute uh Toupa’n galmuanga a bawl ma leh Toupa na Pathian un Jordan gal a gam a piak a luahsam matan uh; Huchi in nou a tuam ding ua ka honpiak ah na hongpai nawn ding uh, chi in thu ka honpia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huailai mah in Joshua bel, Toupa na Pathian un huai kumpipa nihte tung a thilhih tengteng na mit in a muvek a; huchi mah bang in na lutna ding gam tengteng tung ah Toupa’n a hih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amaute lau ke’n; a hon doupihpa Toupa na Pathian uh ahi ngal a” chi in thu ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huailai mah in Toupa ka ngen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“ Toupa Pathian aw, na sikha kiang ah na thupidan leh na khut hattak na langsak ahi peuhmah ngei hi. Van ah hiam, lei ah hiam na thilhih bang leh na thilhih thupitak bang hihthei pathian kua a om a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hon galkah sak inla, Jordan gal a gam hoihtak, huai tang kilawm tak leh Lebanon hon musak in,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Himahleh noute ziak in ka tung ah Toupa a heh mahmah a, ka thu a ngaikhe kei a; Huchi in Toupa’n , “Hunta hen, hiai thu ah hon houpih nawn ke’n, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pisgah tangvum ah va paitou inla, tumlam, mallam, simlam, leh suahlam na mit in en inla, en vialvial in. Jordan kanlou ding na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Himahleh Joshua thupia inla, hanthawn inla, hatsak in. Hiai mipite a pi galkai dia, na va muhtouh ding gam a luah ding uhi” a honchi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchi in Beth peor kiang chin a guam ah i omta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Israelte aw, Toupa na pi leh pute uh Pathian in a honpiak gam dam a na luah theihna ding ua na zuih ding uh k’on hilh dante leh vaihawmte ngaikhia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh thupiak ka honpiak na zuihtheihna ding un, k’on thupiak na behlap ding uh ahi kei a, na kiamsak ding uh leng ahi sam kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Baal-peor ziak a Toupa thilhih na mit un na mu ua; Baal-peor bemi tengteng Toupa na Pathian un na lak ua pan a hihmangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh lenkip peuhmahte bel tutan in dam in a omlai chiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai un, na va luah ding gam ua leng na zuih zel ding un Toupa ka Pathian in thu a honpiak bang geih in dante leh vaihawmte k’on hilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiai dan leh thuseh tengteng za a; “Hiai nam thupi, a pil leh a theisiam mite ahi taktak uh” chi ding namte kiang a hiai in na pilna uh leh na theihsiamna uh lak ding a hih ziak in pilvang tak in hiaite zui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I sap peuhmah chiang ua Toupa i Pathian in a honnaih bang a amau naihzel pathian nei nam thupi kua a om ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hichitak a dik, dan leh vaihawmna, tua na ma ua ka khun tengteng bang dan nei nam thupi dang kua a om a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangteng hiheh, pilvang unla, ngenteltak in kikem phot un. Huchilou in zaw na mit un a thilmuhte na mangngilh ding ua, na damsung un na lungtang ua pan a mangkha ding hi. Na tate uh leh na tute uh sinsak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Horeb tang a Toupa na Pathian uh ma a na din ua, Toupa’n ka kiang a, “Mite hon sap khawmsak in, leitung a a om sungteng ua hon kihtak dan a kisin theihna ding uh leh a tate uh sinsak ding in ka thute k’on zasak ding, a honchih ni na mangngilh kha ding uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in na hongnaih ua, huai tangbul ah na hong ding uhi. Huailai in mei in vansun zenin huai tang a kang a, meipi vom leh mial in a khuhlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n mei apan a hon houpih a; a thugen naza ua, himahleh lim bangmah na mu kei ua, aw ging lel naza uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thukhun zui dia nou thu a honpiak, thupiak sawm na kiang uah a genkhia a, suang pek nih ah a gelh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huailai in luahdia na va galkahna gam ua na zuih ding un dante leh vaihawmte sinsak di’n Toupa’n thu a honpia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huaiziak in, pilvang mahmah un. Horeb tang a mei apan Toupa’n nou a hon houpih ni’n lim bangmah na mu kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nou leh nou kihihsia in, milim gelh kibawl in, lim kibatpih, a pa lim hiam, a nu lim hiam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />lei tung a om gamsa kibatpih, huihkhua a leng kha nei vasa kibatpih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />lei a vak thilte kibatpih, lei nuai a tui a om ngasa mawngmawng kibatpih na kibawl kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vanlam na nga un, ni, kha, aksite, van a om tengteng leng na mu un, Toupa na Pathian un van nuai a mi tengteng a hon sehsakte un honhip in, hiaite bia in a na uh na sepsak kha ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa’n a mite, a gou hi ding in sik haltuina apan, Aigupta gam apan nou a hon pikhe zawta ahi, tu a na hih mah bang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hiai kia leng hilou in, noute ziak in Toupa ka tung ah a heh a, Jordan lui ka galkah louh a, na luah ding ua gam hoihtak Toupa na Pathian un a honpiak a ka lutlouhna di’n leng a kichiam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei zaw hiai gam a si ding ka hi a, Jordan luigal kahlou ding ka hi. Nou bel na galkah ding ua, hiai gam hoihtak na luah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pilvang mahmah un, Toupa na Pathian uh thukhun, na kiang ua a khun na mangngilh ding ua, Toupa na Pathian un a kibatpih himhim bawl a phallouh milimte na ki bawltawm kha mahmah ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh katmanghat mei, mullithat Pathian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu leh tate na neih ua, huai gam a sawt kuam na ten nung ua, na kihih thulimlouh ua, banghiam a kibatpih peuh a milim bawltawm lelte na bawl khiak ua, hihheh dia Toupa na Pathian uh mitmuh a thil hoihlou na hih maizen uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jordan kan a na va luah ding uh gam apan na mangthang pah ding uh, chih na tungtang thu ua hon theihpih di’n tuin lei leh van ka chial ahi. Sawt na teng kei ding ua, na mangthang vek mai ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Toupa’n namchih lak ah a hon dalhsak dia, Toupa’n a hon paimang sakna namte lak ah tawmchik kia na teng ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huai ah, sing leh suang a a bawl uh pathiante, mu theilou peuh, za theilou peuh, ne theilou peuh, dik theilou peuh na be ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Himahleh huailai mah a Toupa na Pathian uh na zon ua, na lungtang tengteng uh leh na lungsim tengteng ua na zon uh leh na mu ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Haksa a na om ua, na tung ua hiai thil tengteng a hongtun chiang in, Toupa na Pathian uh lam na hong nga khongkhong ding ua, a thu na zuita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh lah chitna a dim Pathian ahi ngal a; a hon donsak lou kei dia, a hon hihmang kei ding. Na pi leh pute uh kiang a kichiam a a thukhun a mangngilh hetkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Na omma uh, nidanglaite sui le uchin leitung a Pathian in mihing a siam nungsiah van nuai ah, hichibang a thil thupi a om ngei in, zak ahi ngei ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na zak bang un, mei apan Pathian aw min a za ngei mawngmawng in, a hing uhia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Namdang lak apan khemna, chiamtehna, thillamdang, kidouna, khut hattak, banzak, thil mulkimhuai a Toupa na Pathian un na mitmuh ua Aigupta gam a a hih tengteng bang a nam pikhe ngam Pathian a om ngei hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Toupa Pathian ahi, chih na theih theihna ding ua na kiang ua hihlat ahi a; amah loungal a dang a omkei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A hon sinsak theihna ding in van apan a aw a hon zasak a, leitung ah a mei thupi a hon musak a, mei apan a thu na za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Na pi leh pute uh a it ziak in a nung ua a suante uh a hontela, a mitmuh in a thilhihtheihna thupitak in Aigupta gam apan a honpi khia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Namdang nou sang a thupi leh thilhihthei zaw a hon delh khiaksak a, a gam uh a hon luahsak a, tua na hih mah bang un a hon lutsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Huaiziak in, tuin na lungtang un vom unla, tunglam van ah leh nuailam lei ah Toupa zaw Pathian ahi, chih thei un. A dang himhim kuamah a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tangtawn a dia Toupa na Pathian un nou a honpiak gam ah noumau leh na suante uh adia hoih ding leh na tensawt theihna ding un, a dante leh a thupiakte, tua ka honpiakte na zuih ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Huchi in Mosi in Jordan gal, nisuahna lam pang ah khopi thum a sep hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tualthatmi, a invengte, tuma lam a leng mudah khollou, mi thatkha humbitna ding in, hiai khua khat peuhpeuh a, a tailut leh humbit in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Huai khuate hiaite ahi uh: Reubente gam a Bezer khopi; Gadte gam Gilead a Ramoth khopi leh Manassehte gam Bashan a Golan ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hiai Mosi in Israel suante a piak dan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hiaite Mosi piak theihsaknate, danthusehte leh dante ahi. Huai bel Aigupta gam apan a hongpawt khiak lai uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Sihon gam, Jordan lui suahlam a Beth Peor kiang phaizang a, a omlai ua a piak ahi. Sihon bel Amorte kumpipa, Heshbon a vaihawmpa, Mosi leh Israelte’n Aigupta apan a hongpaikhiak lai ua a zohpa uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Amau Sihon gam leh Bashan kumpipa Og gam a luah uhi. Amau nihte Jordan lui suahlam a Amor kumpipa nihte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hiai gam ahihleh Arnon guam gei a Aroer apan Sion tang, Hermon leng a chih uh, pha a kizalh ahi. Sion tang in min dang a nei a, Hermon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Huai gam in Jordan lui suahlam a Arabah luipiau tengteng, Pisgah tang a tuinakte nuai a Arabah tuipi tan a huap hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Mosi in Israel tengteng a samkhawm a, a kiang uah: Israel mite aw, Na sin ua na zuih ding uh dante, vaihawmte tuni a na bil ua na zak ua ka gen ngaikhia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in Horeb ah eite toh kikal ah thu a khung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa’n hiai thu i pi leh pute kiang ah a na khungkei a, eite, tu tan a hingdam a omlai tengteng kiang ah ahi, a khun zawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa’n tang ah mei apan kimaituah in a hon houpih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huailai in Toupa thu nou hon kawkmuh di’n Toupa toh na kikal uah ka ding a; mei ziak in lah na lau ngal ua, tang ah na hohtou kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei Toupa Pathian, Aigupta gam a saltanna inn apan hon pikhepa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei loungal pathian dangte na nei ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Milim bawl tawm, tunglam van a om hiam, nuai lam lei a om hiam, lei nuailam a tui a om hiam, a koi batpih mahmah na kibawl ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaite ma ah na kun ding uh ahi kei a, a na uh leng na sem ding uh ahi kei. Kei Toupa na Pathian uh Pathian mullithat, pate khelhna ziak a tate gawtzel, hon mudahte suan thumna leh suan lina tan a gawtzel leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a hon itte, ka thupiakte zuimi sang tampite tung a hehpihna langsak zel ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian min na lou mawkmawk ding ahi kei. Toupa’n a min lou mawkmawkte lah mawhlou in a khah ngal kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian in thu a honpiak bang in Sabbath ni tang siangthou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ni guk sung nna nasem dia, nna tengteng na sem ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A ni sagih ni, Toupa na Pathian ading in Sabbath ahi. Huai ni’n nang, na tapa, na tanu, na sikhapa, na sikhanu, na bawngtal, na sabiltung, na gan lak a a koi mahmah in leng, na inn a gamdang mite’n leng nna himhim a sem ding ahi kei. Nangmah bang in na sikhapate, na sikhanute leng a khawl ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang leng Aigupta gam ah sikha na hikhin a, Toupa na Pathian in huai apan khut hat leh banzak a, a hon pikhiak na hi, chih theigige in. Huaiziak in ahi, Toupa na Pathian in Sabbath ni tang dia thu a honpiak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian in thu a honpiak bang in na nu leh na pa zahtak in. Huchi in Toupa’n gam a honpiak ah lamzang in, na damsawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tual na that ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ang na kawm ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na gu ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na invengte tung ah theihpih taklou in na pang ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na invengte zi na eng ding ahi kei, na invengte inn hiam, a lou hiam, a sikhapa hiam, a sikhanu hiam, a bawngtal hiam, a sabiltung hiam, na invengte thil bangmah na eng ding ahi kei, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hiai thute tang a mei, meipi leh mialsah bikbek apan Toupa’n aw ngaihtak in na vek ua kikhawmte kiang ah a gen a, a behlap nawn tuankei hi. Huaite suangpek nih ah a gelh a, a honpia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tang a kat lai a, mial apan aw na zak un, hichi ahi a, na nam ua intekpen teng leh na upate un honnaih uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nou ngai in, “ Toupa i Pathian in i kiang uah a thupidan leh a letdan a langsak a, mei apan a aw i za uh. Pathian in mihing a houpih a leng na sih tuanlouh dan uh tuni in na theita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huaiziak in bangdia si ding i hi ua? Hiai mei thupitak in a hon kangmang mai ding. Toupa i Pathian aw i zak nawn leh zaw i si mai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mei apan Pathian hing aw i zak bang a za sam a lah hing ngal mihing tengteng lak ah kua a om a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nang va naih inla, Toupa i Pathian in a gen ding tengteng va ngaikhe dihve. Toupa i Pathian in na kiang a, a gen tengteng kou kiang ah na gen dia; Huchi in ka na ngaikhe ding ua, ka zui ding uh” na chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />N’on houpih lai ua na thugen uh Toupa’n a naza a; Huchi in Toupa’n ka kiang ah, “Hiai mipite’n na kiang a thu a gen uh ka naza a; a thugen tengteng uh a gen hoih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchibang lungsim pu gige le uh aw, laudan a honsiam ding ua, ka thupiak a zui gige ding ua, amau leh a tate uh tangtawn in a lamzang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pai inla, a puanbuk ua kiknawn di’n amau hilh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Himahleh a luah ding ua ka piak ding gam a a zuih ding ua na sinsak ding thupiak, danthuseh leh dante tengteng k’on piak theihna ding in nang zaw hiai ah om tadih in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa na Pathian un thu a honpiak bang a hih ding in pilvang un. Taklam ah hiam, veilam ah hiam na pial ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na va luah ding uh gam a na hin ua, na lamzanna ding uh leh na ten sawt theihna ding un, Toupa na Pathian un thu a honpiak lampi na zuih tawnsuak ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Luah dia na va galkahna gam ua na zuih ding ua, Toupa na Pathian un nou hon sinsak dia thu a honpiak, thupiak, danthuseh leh dan hiaite ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huai bel nou leh na tapate uh leh na tupate un Toupa na Pathian uh laudan na siam ua, na damsung teng ua a dan leh a thupiak k’on piak tengteng na zuihna ding uh leh na hong ten sawt theihna ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Israel mite aw, lamzang a Toupa , na pi leh pute uh Pathian in a hon kamchiam bang a nawitui leh khuaizu luanna gam a nakpitak a na hongpun theihna ding un, ngaikhia unla, zui ding in pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel mite aw, ngaikhia un, Toupa na Pathian uh kia Toupa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh na lungtang tengteng un, na lungsim tengteng un, na hatna tengteng un na it ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiai thu, tuni a ka honpiak na lungtang uah a tam gige ding a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />na tate uh phatuamngai tak in na sinsak ding ua, na in ua na tutlai un, lampi a na pailai un, na luplai un leh na thoh chiang un na gen ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chiamtehna ding in na ban uah na vial ding ua, na mit kikal uah talgakna di’n a om ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na inn kongkhak biang leh na kongkhak uah na gelh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, Toupa na Pathian un na pu uh Abraham, Isak leh Jakob kiang a kichiam a a honpiak gam, na bawlkhiak uh hi hetlou,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />khaw thupi leh kilawm taktakte, na hihdim uh hi hetlou, thil hoih chiteng a dim innte, na leh uh hi hetlou, tuikhuk lehsate, na suan uh hi hetlou, grephuan leh olive singte omna a hon pilut a, na nek ua, na tai chiang un, pilvang mahmah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchilou in zaw Aigupta gam a saltanna inn apan hon pikhia Toupa na mangngilh kha mahmah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh laudan na siam ding ua, amah nna nasem ding ua, a minlou in na kichiam ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />pathian dangte na zui ding uh ahi kei, na kim ua mite pathiante na be ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na lak ua Toupa na Pathian uzaw Pathian mullithat ahi; Toupa na Pathian uh na tung uah a heh dia, lei apan a hon hihmang kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Massah a na ze-et bang un Toupa na Pathian uh na ze-et ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a honpiak, a thupiakte, a thu theihsakte leh a dante pilvang tak in na zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa mitmuh a dik leh hoih na hih ding uh ahi. Huchi in nou ading in a hoih dia, Toupa’n na pi leh pute uh kiang a, a chiam gam hoih a lut in, na luahthei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa’n a gensa bang in, na ma ua kipan na melma tengteng uh a hawlkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na tate un, “ Toupa i Pathian un thu a honpiak, a thu theihsaknate, dante, thusehte, bangchidan ahia?” chi a tunung lam chiang a a hondot chiang un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nou na tate uh kiang ah, “Aigupta gam ah Pharo sikha i na hi ua, Toupa’n Aigupta gam apan khut hattak in a hon pikhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa’n i mitmuh un Aigupta gam tung ah, Pharo tung ah, a inkuanpih tengteng tung ah, chiamtehna leh thillamdang thupi mahmah a musak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eibel honpe dia i pi leh pute kiang a piak ding chi a a kichiam gam a honpiak theihna ding in huai gam apan a hon pikhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in hiai dan tengteng zui ding leh i hoih tawntungna dia Toupa i Pathian laudansiam ding in Toupa’n thu a honpia a, tuni a mihinga a honhawi theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A thu honpiak bang a Toupa ma a thupiak tengteng zui dia i pilvan leh ei adin damna ahi ding” na chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nava luah ding uh gamsung a Toupa na Pathian un a hon pilut a, na ma ua nam tampi, Hitte, Girgaste, Amorte, Kanaante, Perizte, Hivte leh Jebuste, nou sang a thupizaw leh hatzaw nam sagihte, a delhkhiak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un amaute nou a honpiak a, na thahgam chiang un amaute na hihgam sipsip ding ua; amaute toh thukhun na bawl ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zi leh ta in na nei ding uh ahi kei. Na tanute uh a tapate uh toh na kiteng sak ding uh ahi kei. A tanute uh na tapate uh toh na kiteng sak ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na tapate uh, kei hon zuilaite pathian dangte biakna ah a pikawi mai ding uhi. Huchi in Toupa na tung uah a heh dia, a hon hihmang pah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A tung uah hichibang in na hih zaw ding uh ahi. A maitam uh na hihchim ding ua, a suangphuhte uh na kitam zansak ding ua, a Aserte uh na phuk ding ua, a milim bawl tawmte uh na halvek ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh ading in lah nam siangthou na hi ngal ua. Leitung a nam tengteng tung a Amah a tuam dia Toupa na Pathian un a hon tel na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Namdang sang a na tamzawk ziak ua Toupa’n na tung uah a itna tusak in, a hon tel ahi kei a, namdang tengteng a nam tawmpen na hi zawmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n nou a hon it ziak in leh na pi leh pute uh kiang a, a na kichiamna tangtun a ut ziak in ahizaw, Toupa’n Aigupta kumpipa Pharo khut apan leh saltanna inn apan khut hat mahmah a hon tatkhiak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Toupa na Pathian uh Pathian ahi chih thei un. Pathian muanhuai, amah it a a thu zuimi tung a suan sang khat tan a a thukhun leh hehpihna zui gige.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amah hawte hihmang dia a maitang mahmah ua thukzel ahi. Amah hawte a halsawt kei dia, a maitang mahmah uah a thuk ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaiziak in, a thupiakte, a dante, a danthusehte, zui dia tuni a thu k’on piak na zuih ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi ding a, a vaihawmte na ngaihkhiak ua, na zuih ua, na hih ziak un Toupa na Pathian un na pi leh pute uh kiang a, a na kichiamna thukhun leh hehpihna na tung uah a zui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Noute a hon it dia, a hon vualzawl dia, a hon hihpung ding hi. Piak dia na pi leh pute uh kiang a, a na kichiamna gam ah na gil ua gah leh na leigah uh leng a vualzawl lai ding. Na buhte uh, na uainte uh, na thaute uh; na bawngnou uh leh na belamnoute uh leng a vualzawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nam tengteng tung ah vualzawl na hi ding ua; na lak uah numei hiam pasal hiam, na gan lak uah leng ching himhim a omkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa’n hipi tengteng a hon hihtheng sak vek dia, na theih sa uh Aigupta gam hipite na tung uah a tungsak kei dia, nou honhawte tengteng tung ah a tungsak zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a honpiak ding nam tengteng na hihmang vek ding uhi. Na hehpih ding uh ahi kei a, a pathiante uh nna nasem ding uh ahi kei; huaite nou adia thang a hih ding ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na lungsim ua, “Hiai namte lah ei sang in a tamzaw ngal ua, bangchi’n i hawlkhe thei dia?” chi na hih uh leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amau kihta kei un. Toupa na Pathian un Pharo leh Aigupta mi tengteng tung a a thilhihte theigige un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ze-etna thupitak na mit mahmah ua na muhte uh, chiamtehnate, thillamdangte, khut hat takte leh banzakte a Toupa na Pathian un nou a honpi khiak; huchibang in Toupa Pathian in na mi lauhte uh tung ah a hih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Noumau apan kibute leh a khosuak sunte a manthat vek tan un Toupa na Pathian un a lak uah tunpite a sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amau na lau ding uh ahi kei. Pathian thupitak leh lauhuaitak Toupa na Pathian uh na lak uah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un huai namte awlawl in a hon delhkhiak sak ding. Amau na hihmang pah ding uh ahi kei, huchilou in zaw nou adin gamsate a hong tam lawkha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aman masiah uh Toupa na Pathian un a honpe dia, buai petmah in a hihbuai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A kumpipate uh na khut uah a honpe dia, a min uh van nuai apan na thaimang sipsip ding uh ahi. Na hih man sipsip tan un kuamah in a hondal zoukei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A pathian lim bawltawmte uh na hal ding uh ahi. Huaite dangkasik hiam, dangkaeng hiam na enlah ding uh ahi kei. Nou adia na lak ding uh ahi kei. Huchilou in zaw na awk kha ding uhi; Toupa na Pathian uh adia thil kihhuai ahi ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na inn sung ua thil kihhuai lalut in huai thil bang in hamsiat thuak ding in na kibawl ding uh ahi kei. Kih petmah a kih in na mudah mahmah ding uh ahi, hamsiat thuakna thillah ahi ngal ua.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chidam ludam a na om ua, na hong tam semsem ua, nou honpe dia na pi leh pute uh kiang a Toupa’n a kichiamna gam na va luah theihna ding un k’on thupiak tengteng zui ding in pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thupiakte na zui ding uhia, zui lou ding, na lungsim uh theihna dia ze-et ding leh hon hihgim dia gamdai a kum sawmli sung nou a hon pina lampi tengteng theigige un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihing tanghou kia in a hing kei. Toupa kam a thu chih pawt in a hing zaw, chih nou a hon theihsak theihna di’n a hon hihgim a, na kial uh a phal a, na theih ngeilouh uh, na pi leh pute un leng a theih ngeilouh uh manna in a hon vak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hiai kum sawmli sung in na puansilhte uh na silh tulkei ua, na khete uh leng a bawkkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Min a ta a sawi bang in Toupa na Pathian un nou a honsawi ahi, chih na lungsim un thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lampi zui dia amah laudan siam di’n Toupa na Pathian uh thupiakte na zui ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un guam leh tang apan hong pawtkhia luitui, tuikhuk leh tui thukpi omna gam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />buh, barli buh, grep, theipi leh theibuhfai te omna gam; thaunei olive leh khuaizu omna gam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />kitatlak lou a tanghou na nekna ding gam uh, bangmah na taksap louhna ding uh, a suangte bang sik, a tangte dal laihkhiak theihna gam hoih mahmah ah nou a hon pilut ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na neih ua, na tai mahmah chiang un, gam hoih mahmah a honpiak ziak in Toupa na Pathian uh na phat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A thupiakte, a danthusehte leh a dante, tuni a ka honpiak zuilou in Toupa na Pathian uh na mangngilh kha mahmah ding uh, pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchilou in zaw na nek ua, na tai ua, in hoih taktak na lam ua, na luah chiang un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />na ganhon uh, na belamhon uh a hongtam a, na dangka uh, na dangkaeng uh a hongtam a, na thilneih tengteng uh a hongtam hun chiang in na lungtang uh a kisathei kha dia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aigupta gam a saltanna inn apan nou hon pikhepa Toupa na Pathian uh na mangngilh mai kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman gamdai zatak leh lauhuai tak, gul gukhahte leh aikamte omna, tui omlouhna, gamkeu ah a honpi paisuak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />meisahsuang suangpi apan tui a hon pawtkhesak a, na pi leh pute uh theih ngeilouh, manna in nou a honvak a, tunung chiang khualna a na hoih theihna ding un nou a hon hihgim a, a hon ze-et theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Hiai i sum leh paite eimah hatna leh i khut hatna in a sep khiak ahi” na lungtang un na chi kha ding uh, pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua na kip bang ua na pi leh pute uh kiang a kichiam a thu a khun a hih kipna di’n Toupa na Pathian uh theigige un, sum leh pai muhkhiak theihna hon pepa lah amah a hingal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hichi ahi dia, Toupa na Pathian uh na mangngilh ua, pathian dangte na zuih ua, a na uh nasep ua, na biak uleh, na mangthang ngeingei ding uh, chih tuni in k’on theisak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na ma ua namdangte a hih manthat bang in noute leng na mangthang ding ua, Toupa na Pathian aw ngaikhe utlou na hih ding ziak un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mite aw, ngaikhia un, nou sang a thupizaw leh thilhihtheizaw namte, khopi vansun a kulh daikaih leh thupi luah di’n tuni in Jordan galkah a, na kuan ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Milian leh sang, Anak suante, Anak suante ma ah kua ading zou dia?” a chih uh na theih uh leh zaksa uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Toupa na Pathian uh kattum hat mei bang a na ma ua pai ahi, chih tuni in thei un. Aman amaute a hih mangthang dia, a hon hihniam sak ding. Huchi in Toupa’n na kiang ua a gensa bang in, amau na delh khe ding ua, na hih mangthang pah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a hon delh khiaksak khit chiang in, “I diktat ziak a hiai luah dia Toupa’n hon pilut ahi, na lungsim un chi kei hial un.” Hiai namte a gitlouh ziak un ahizaw, Toupa’n a hon delhkhiak sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na diktat ziak u hiam, na lungsim uh dik ziak hiam in, a gam uh na luahkei ding ua, hiai namte gitlouh ziak leh Toupa’n na pu uh Abraham, Isak leh Jakob kiang a, a kichiamna hihkip ding in Toupa na Pathian un amau a hon delh khiaksak ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in, hiai gam hoih mahmah na diktat ziak ua luah di’n Toupa’n honpia ahi kei chih thei un. Nam paupengpi lah na hi ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gamdai a Toupa na hehsak nak dante uh theigige unla, mangngilh kei un. Aigupta gam apan na pawt ni ua kipan hiai mun na hongtun tan un Toupa tung a helhat na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Horeb ah leng Toupa na hehsak ua, nou honhih mangthang ding khop hial in Toupa a heh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Suangpek, na kiang ua Toupa’n thu a khunna suangpek la dia tang a ka va hohtouh lai in, ni sawmli leh zan sawmli tang ah ka va om a; tanghou lah ka nekei a, tui leng ka dawn sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa’n suangpek nih, Pathian khut zung a gelh a honpia a; huai ah na kikhop khawm ni ua tang tung a mei apan Toupa’n na kiang ua thu a gen tengteng a tuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni sawmli leh zan sawmli khit in hichi ahi a, suangpek nih, thukhun suangpek a honpia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah, “Thou inla, hiai apan paisuk meng in, Aigupta gam apan na pikhiak na mite a kihihse khinta uhi. Zuih dia k’on thupiak lampi apan a pialmangta uh, milim suntawm a kibawl uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaite ban ah, “ Toupa’n , hiai mite ka etet leh, ngai in, nam paupeng ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amau hih mangthang ding leh van nuai apan a min uh thaimang ding in ka hih dandan in ka hih mai ding. Amau sang a nam thilhihtheizaw leh thupizaw in nang k’on bawl ding” chi’n leng a hon houpih lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in tang apan ka kihei a, ka paisuk a, tang a kangta, thukhun suangpek nihte ka khut lang nih in ka tawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in ka en a, ngai un, Toupa na Pathian uh tung ah na khialta uhi. Bawngnou lim suntawm na kibawl ua; Toupa’n thu a honpiak lampi na pialsanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Suangpek nihte ka dom a, ka khut lang nih apan ka pai a, na mitmuh un ka hihkhamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuma a ka hih bang in ni sawmli leh zan sawmli Toupa ma ah ka khupboh hi. Amah hihheh dia Toupa mitmuh a na thilhih khelhsa uh, nou khelhna tengteng ziak in tanghou ka ne kei a, tui leng ka dawn sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nou honhih mangthang dia Toupa hehna, a thangpaihna leh a lungkimlouhna mahmah lah ka lau ngal a. Himahleh huailai in leng Toupa’n ka thu a hon ngaihkhiak sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa bel Aron hih mangthang nuam hial khop in a heh a; himahleh Aron mah leng ka thumsak pah ngal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na khelhna uh ziak a na bawl uh bawngnou lim ka la a, ka hal a, ka satzan a, leivui bang in ka gawinel dimdem a; a nel tang apan a lui hongluang ah ka pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Taberah, Massah leh Kibroth-hattaavah ah leng Toupa na hih heh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toupa’n , K’on gam piak valuah un, chi a, Kadesh-barnea apan a honsawllai in, Toupa na Pathian uh thupiak na helsan ua, Amah na gingta kei ua, A aw lah na ngaikhe sam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />K’on theih tung apan Toupa tung a helhat mi na hi gige uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n , Ka hih mangthang ding, a honchih ziak in Toupa ma ah ni sawmli leh zan sawmli sung ka khupboh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Toupa kiang ah ka thum a, Toupa Pathian aw, na thupina a tat, khut hattak a Aigupta gam apan na tatkhiak, na mite leh na goutante hih mangthang ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na sikha Abraham, Isak leh Jakob theigige inla, hiai mite phengphit dan, gitlouh dan leh a khelh dante uh en ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchilou in zaw n’on pikhiakna gam a mite’n Toupa’n a gam chiam a a pi lut theihlouh ziak leh a muhdah ziak in gamdai a thah di’n a pi khia, a chi kha ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na thilhihtheihna thupitak leh na banzak a na pikhiak, na mite leh na goutante lah ahi ngal ua, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huailai in Toupa’n ka kiang ah, “Suangpek nih tuma lam a te bang seknawn inla, tang ah ka kiang ah hongpai inla, singkuang bawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuma lam a suangpek na hih khapte a thu tuangte suangpekte ah ka gelh dia, singkuang ah na koih ding ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in singgi sing in singkuang ka bawl a, tuma lam a bang suangpek nih ka sek a, suangpek nihte tawi in tang ah ka hohtou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Suangpekte ah a ma a gelh bang, na kikhopkhawm ni ua tang a mei apan Toupa’n na kiang ua a gen thupiak sawm a gelh a, Toupa’n a honpia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tang apan ka ki heisuk nawn a, suangpek ka singkuang bawl ah ka koih hi. Toupa’n thu a honpiak bang in huai ah a om nilouh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel suante Bene-jaakan tuileh apan Moserah ah a pai ua; huai ah Aron a si a, huai ah a vui uhi. A tapa Eleazar in amun ah siampu na a sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huai apan Gudgodah ah a pai ua; Gudgodah apan tuiluite gam Jotbathah ah a pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huailai in tutan a Toupa thukhun singkuang zawng a, A ma a Toupa nasem a, A min a vualzawl sakmi hi ding in Levi chi a septuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Levi in a unaute lak ah tantuan, goutan a neikei hi. Toupa na Pathian un a kiang a a gen bang in Toupa a goutan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A malam mah bang in tang ah, ni sawmli ka om a; huailai in leng Toupa’n ka thu a ngaikhia a, Toupa’n nou a honhih mangthang kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah, “Thou inla, mipite makai in; amaute piak dia a pi leh pute uh kiang a kichiam a ka chiam gam a luah ding uh ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khaile, Israel mite aw, nou apan Toupa na Pathian un a hon phut bang dang ahia, na hoihna ding ua Toupa na Pathian uh laudansiam a, a lampi tengteng tawn a, amah it a, na lungtang tengteng uleh na lungsim tengteng ua Toupa na Pathian uh na sem a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa thupiakte, a dante zuih dia tua thu ka honpiak zuih hilou maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai un, van leh van sangpente leh lei leh asung a om tengteng Toupa na Pathian uh avek ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh na pi leh pute it bel amah kipahlam ahi a, namdang tengteng tung ah noute, amau nung a a suante uh tua na hih mah bang un a hon na telta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huaiziak in, na lungtang vun uh sum unla, genhak nawn kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian u lah pathiante Pathian, heutute Heutu, Pathian thupitak, hattak, lauhuaitak, kuamah deihsak tuam neilou a, golhna leng la ngeilou ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pa neiloute leh meithaite hoihtak in vai a hawmsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huaiziak in, gamdang mite it sam un; nou leng Aigupta gam ah gamdang mi na hi ngeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh laudan na siam ding ua, amah nna nasem ding ua; amah na len chinten ding ua, a minlou in na kichiam ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah na phat dingpa uh ahi, hiai na mit ua na muh khitsa uh thil thupitak leh mulkimhuai takte hon hihsakpa na Pathian uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na pi leh pute uh Aigupta gam ah mi sawmsagih a paisuk ua; tuin bel tamlam in van a aksi zah in Toupa na Pathian un a hon tam sakta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Toupa na Pathian uh na it un a thusehte, a dante, a vaihawmte leh a thupiakte na zui gige ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuin thei un, Toupa na Pathian sawina, a thupidan, a ban hatdan, a banzak dan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a chiamtehnate, a thilhih, Aigupta gam sung a Aigupta kumpipa Pharo tung leh a gamsung tengteng a a hihte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aigupta sepaihte leh a sakol leh a kangtalai tung a a thilhihte; nou a hon delhzui ua, Tuipi San a a tum sakdan, tutan a Toupa’n a hih manthat dante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hiai mun na tun masiah ua gamdai a na tung ua a thilhih theih dante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Reuben tapa Eliab tapa Dathan leh Abiram tung a a hih dan; lei in a kam a kata, Israel mite tengteng lak a amaute leh a inkuanpihte uh leh a puaninte uh leh a ganhon tengteng uh a valhvek dante theilou na suante uh kiang a thu gen ka hi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na mit ngei ua Toupa’n thil thupitak, a hih tengteng mute kiang a thugen ka hi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaiziak in, na honghat ua, luah dia na vazot gam uh na luah theihna ding un, tuni a k’on piak thupiak tengteng na zuih ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nawitui leh khuaizu luanna gam, na pi leh pute leh a suante kiang a piak dia Toupa’n a kichiamna gam a na ten sawt theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai na va luah ding uh gam, na hong pawtna uh Aigupta gam, anteh louhing huan a haichi na tuh ua, na khe ua tui na buah uh bang uh ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na valuah ding uh gam zaw, tang leh guam leh van vuahtui mu gam ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh zonkhiak gam ahi a; Toupa na Pathian uh mit kum thak apan kumtawp pha a tuk gige na gam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, Toupa na Pathian uh it ding leh na lungtang tengteng uh leh na lungsim tengteng ua a na sem dia tu a ka honpiak thupiak tengteng phatuamngaitak a na zuih uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />na gam vuahtui uh a hun geihgeih in, vuahtui ke masa leh vuahtui ke nanung k’on pedia, huchi in na buh uh, na uain uh, na thau uh na seklut thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na gante uh ading in leng na loute uah loupa k’on sawl dia, nou leng na ne ding ua, na tai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pilvang un, huchilou in zaw na lungtang uh zekhem in a om dia, na pial ding ua, pathian dangte na sem in, na be kha ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na huchih uleh Toupa na tung uah a thangpai dia, van a khak dia, vuah a zukei dia, lei in a gah a piangsak kei ding. Huchi in Toupa’n a honpiak, gam hoih apan na mangthang pah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huaiziak in, hiai ka thute na lungtang uleh na lungsim uah khum unla, chiamtehna ding in na ban uah na vial ding ua, na mit kikal uah talgakna di’n leng a om ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huaite na tate uh na sinsak ding ua, na in ua na tutlai un, lampi a na pailai un, na luplai un, na thoh chiang un na gen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na inn kongkhak biangte uah, na kongkhakte uah na gelh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in, na pi leh pute uh piak dia a kichiamna gam ah na damsung nite uh leh na tate uh damsung nite leitung a vante nite bang in a sausak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh it ding leh a lampi tengteng zui ding leh amah len chinten dia phatuamngaitak a hiai thupiak nou k’on piak tengteng na zuih peuhmah uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toupa’n hiai nam tengteng a hon delhkhiak sak dia, nou sang a thupizaw leh thilhihthei zaw namte gam na luah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na khepek ua na sikna peuh uh nou a ahi dia, gamdai apan leh Lebanon tang apan lui, Euphrates lui apan tumlam tuipi pha in na gam uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kuamah in a hon phakei dia; Toupa na Pathian un na kiang ua a gensa bang in na vasik ding uh gam tengteng ah noute kihtakna leh lauhna a omsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ngai un, tuni in na ma uah vualzawlna leh hamsia ka koih hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh thupiakte, tua ka honpiakte na zuih uleh, vualzawlna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh thupiakte na zuih kei uleh, na theih ngeilouh uh pathian dangte be dia tua k’on thupiakte na pialsan uh le bel, hamsiat na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, na va luah ding uh gam a Toupa na Pathian un a hon pilut chiang in, Gerizim tang ah vualzawlna, Ebal tang ah hamsiatna na koih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ni tumna khen, Arabah a om, Kanante gam, Gilgal zawn Moreh tawsaw sik, Jordan gal a te ahi kei umaw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a honpiak gam valuah ding in Jordan na kan ding ua, na luah ding ua, huai ah na teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua na ma ua ka koih, dan leh vaihawm tengteng zui ding in na pilvang ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa na pi leh pute uh Pathian in a honpiak gam na luah ua, leitung a na ten sung ua pilvang tak a na zuih ding uh dante leh vaihawmte hiaite ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na valuah ding uh gam namte’n tang liante, tang neute, sing hing nuai a pathiante na a sepna mun tengteng uh na hihsiat vek ding uh ahi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A maitamte uh na hihchim ding ua, a Aserte uh mei in na hal ding uh ahi. A bawltawm uh pathian limte na phuksak ding ua, huai a minte na hihse ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh tung ah bel huchibang in na hih ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un na nam tengteng lak ua a min omna dia a munseh ding na zong zaw ding ua, huai ah na hoh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huai ah na haltum thillatte uh, na sawm a khatte uh, na vei thillat uh leh na thuchiamte uh, piak dia na chiamsate uh, na ut thu ua thillatte leh na ganhon uh leh na belamhon lak ua piang masapente na hontawi ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huai ah Toupa na Pathian uh ma ah na ne ding ua, na khut koihna peuh ua Toupa na Pathian un a hon vualzawlna ah kipaktak in na om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Michih in amau hoihsak bang chiat a tuni a na hih bang ua na hih ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un nou a honpiak gam leh khawlna lah na tung nai tadih ngal kei ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jordan lui na galkah ua, Toupa na Pathian un a hon luah sak ding gam a na ten ua, bit tak a na ten theihna ding ua na kim ua melma tengteng apan a hon khawlsak chiang in hichi ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a min a omsakna dia a sehna mun ah ka chih tengteng na hontawi ding uh ahi: Na haltum thillatte uh, na kithoihnate uh, na sawm ua khatte uh, na vei thillat uh leh Toupa kiang a na chiamsa uh na neihte ua a hoihpen teng n’on tawi ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh ma ah kipaktak in na om ding ua, noumau leh na tapate uh, na tanute uh toh, na sikhapate uh, na sikhanute utoh, na in ua om, Levite toh, amau lah na lak uah tantuan leh gam a nei ngalkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mun na muh peuh ua na haltum thillatte uh lan mawkmawk lou ding in pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na namte uh lak a Toupa’n a seh ding mun ah na haltum thillatte uh na lanzaw ding ua, huai ah thu k’on piak tengteng na hih ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa na Pathian un vualzawlna a hon muhsak bangzel in na hinna un a lunggulh gulh uh na in chiat uah na gou ding ua, a sa na nethei ding uh. A siangloute leh a siangte’n leng sangai leh sakhi a nethei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A sisan ahihleh na ne ding uh ahi kei. Tui bang in lei ah na sung baw ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na in uah, na buh uh leh na uain thak ua sawm a khat na khuate uah na ne ding uh ahi kei. Ahihkeileh na ganhonte uh leh belamhonte uh leh na kelhonte uh lak a piang masapente ahihkeileh na utthu ua na thillat uh ahihkeileh na vei thilte na khuate uah na ne ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a munseh ding ah, Toupa na Pathian uh ma ah na ne zaw ding uh ahi: Noute leh na tapate uh leh na tanute uh, na sikhapate uh, na sikhanute uh, na in ua om Levite toh. Toupa na Pathian ma uah na khut ngakna peuhmah ah kipaktak in na om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na gam ua na tensung teng un Levite limsaklou a omlou ding in pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a honchiam bang a na gam uh a hih zat a, na hinna un sa nek a ut ziak a, sa ka ne ding, na chih hun chiang un, na hinna un a lunggulh lampeuh sa na ne thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a min omna dia a seh ding mun a gamlat luat leh, thu k’on piak bang in Toupa’n a honpiak na ganhon uleh na belamhon lak ua na gou ding ua, na hinna un a lunggulh lampang na in uah na ne ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sangai sa leh sakhi sa nek a hihbang in na ne ding ua, a siangloute leh a siangte’n leng a kibang in na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sisan ahihleh nelou ding in pilvang un; sisan lah hinna ahi ngal a; hinna toh sa na ne ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na ne mahmah ding uh ahi kei; tui bang in lei ah na sung baw mai ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na ne ding uh ahi kei. Huchi in Toupa mit muh a thil dik na hih un noumau leh nanung ua na tate uh adin a hoih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Himahleh na thil siangthoute uh leh lat dia na thuchiamsate kia uh tawi unla, Toupa’n a munseh ding ah paipih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh maitam ah na haltum thillat uh, a sa leh a sisan na lan ding ua; na kithoihna sisante uh Toupa na Pathian uh maitam ah na sungkhe ding ua, a sa na ne ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hiai k’on thupiak tengteng limsak unla, ngaikhia un, Huchi in Toupa na Pathian uh mitmuh a thil hoih leh thil dik na hih un nou ading leh nanung ua na tate uh ading in tangtawn in a hong hoih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un na zoh ding uh namte a honhih manthat sak a, a gam uh na luah ua, na ten hun chiang un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hihmanthat a a omna ua na awk khaklouhna ding un, pilvang un. Hiai namte’n bangchi’n ahia a pathiante uh na a sep uh? A chih bang un en leng i chi sam ding uh, chi in a pathiante uh tungtang kankei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchibang in Toupa na Pathian tung ah na hih ding uh ahi kei. A pathiante tung uah Toupa theih a thil kihhuai chiteng, a huat mahmahte a hihzel ua; a tapate uh, a tanute ngei uh leng a pathiante uh adin a halzel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hihdia k’on thupiak peuhmah na hih ding uh ahi. Na behlap ding uh ahi kei a, na tawmsak ding uh leng ahi kei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na lak ua zawlnei hiam, mangneimi hiam a hongom a, chiamtehna hiam, thillamdang hiam a hon etsak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />chiamtehna hiam, thillamdang hiam a hon etsak, a hong tangtun a, na theih ngeilouh uh, “pathian dangte zui ni e, a na uh sem ni” na kiang ua a chih leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />huai zawlnei hiam, mangneimi hiam thute na ngaikhe ding uh ahi kei. Toupa na Pathian uh na lungtang tengteng uh leh na hinna tengteng un na it uhia, it lou chih theihtelna din Toupa na Pathian un a hon ze-et ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh na zui ding ua, amah laudan na siam ding ua, a thupiakte na zui ding ua, a thugente na zui ding ua, amah nna nasem ding ua, amah na len chinten ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai zawlnei hiam, mangneimi hiam hihlup ding ahi. Aigupta gam apan honpi khia a, saltanna inn apan hon tanpa Toupa na Pathian un zuih ding thu a honpiak lampi apan hon pialsak dia, Toupa na Pathian uh tung a helna thu a gen ziak in, huchibang in na lak ua thil hoihlou na hihmang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na unaupa, na nu tapa hiam, na tapa hiam, na tanu hiam, na zi pomlai hiam, na lawm nangmah hinna bang hial nangawn in leng, hon zekhem a, kisa ni, “pathian dangte na sem ni” a chih leh; nang hiam, na pipute hiam in leng na theihlouh uh pathiante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />na kimvel ua, na kiangchin ua omte hiam, na kigamlat pih deuh uhiam, kawlmong apan kawlmong khatlam pha a mite pathiante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />pha na sakpih ding uh ahi kei, amah na ngaikhe ding uh ahi sam kei. Na hehpih ding uh ahi kei a, na hawi ding uh leng ahi sam kei, na im ding uh leng ahi sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na hihlup ngeingei ding uh ahizaw. That ding in khut na kha masa dia, huaikhit chiang in mipi tengteng in a khut uh a kha ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Suang a na denlup ding uh ahi, Aigupta gam a saltanna inn apan hon pikhepa Toupa na Pathian ua kipan hon pialsakna ding a zon ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Israel mi tengteng in a za ding ua, a lau ding ua, na lak ua huchibang tatsiatna himhim a chingta kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un na tenna ding ua a honpiak na khua khat a na lak ua kipan Belial tate khenkhat hongpawt a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />huai khopi a mite na theih ngeilouh uh “pathian dangte be ding in a pimang uh” chih thu kigen na zak uleh kan unla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ding khia unla, phatuamngaitak in dongkhia un. Ngai un, thudik a na hih a, huchibang thil kihhuai na lak ua hih ahi, chih theihtel ahihleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Namsau a huai khua a tengte na hihlup ngeingei ding uh ahi. Asung a om tengteng, ganhonte toh namsau in na hih mangthang vek ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gallak thil teng kholak ah na la khawm ding ua, khua leh gallak thil teng Toupa na Pathian uh kiang ah haltum thillat in na hal ding ua, leivui lel ahi tawntung ding a, lamthak ahi nawn kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gallak thil bangmah na khoih ding uh ahi kei. Toupa a heh mahmahna a kiheisan dia, chitna a hon musak ding a, a hon hehpih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh mitmuh a thil hoih hihdia tua k’on piak thupiak tengteng na zuih peuhmah uleh nou a hon pungsak ding hi, na pi leh pute uh kiang a a na kichiam khit bang in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh tate na hi ua; misi ziak in na ki atkeh ding uh ahi kei. Na mitmul uh leng na metmai ding uh ahi sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian ading in nam siangthou na hi uh. Leitung a nam tengteng tung ah amah a tuammawng hidia Toupa’n a hon tel na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thil kihhuai himhim na ne ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hiai sate ahi, na nek theih ding uh: Bawngtal, belam, kel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />sakhi, sangai, sakhi tal, sathak, gamkel, gamlawi leh gam belam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sa chiteng, a chin ka, a chin ka paisuak, eknel hai chi peuhmah na ne thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh eknel hailel leh a chin uh leng ka ngalte, na nekding uh ahi kei. Sangawngsau, zupi leh zusapi in eknel a hai na ua, a chin uh a kat louh ziak in nou ading in sianglou ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vok ahihleh a chin a ka na a, eknel a hailouh ziak in nou ading in sianglou ahi; a sa na ne ding uh ahi kei a, a siluang leng na khoih ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tui a tengte lak ah hiaite na ne thei ding uh: phe leh lip nei peuhmah na ne thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Phe leh lip neilou peuhmahte na ne theikei ding uh, nou ading in sianglou ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vasa siang tengteng na ne thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hiaite zaw na ne ding uh ahi kei: Muvanlai, mungawnggiau, mu akla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Musane, mu meika, mu chi himhim;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Va ak chi himhim;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Simbu, zan mu, mu chi himhim, tuipi mu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Simbu neu, simbu lian, simbutanglip;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gamdai simbu, musane, va ngawngsau;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuipi, tuiva lian chi himhim, huihtun leh bak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kha nei khe a pai chi himhim nou ading in sianglou ahi uh, nekding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vasa siang tengteng na ne thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah sih a si bangmah na nekding uh ahi kei. Na ompih uh gamdang mite nek ding in na pe thei ding uh. Namdang mite kiang ah leng na zuak thei ding uh. Nou zaw Toupa na Pathian uh ading in nam siangthou na hi uhi. Kelnou a pi nawitui in na huan ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kum chih in na lou ua antung tengteng sawm a khat na piak ngeingei ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh laudan siamna dan n’on theihgige theihna ding un sawm a khat, na buh uh, na uain uh, na thau uh leh na bawnghon uh leh na belamhon lak ua piang masapente Toupa na Pathian uh ma ah, a min omna dia a seh ding ah na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a hon vualzawl chiang in, Toupa na Pathian un a min omna ding a seh ding a gamlat luat ziak a nou ading a a lampi a sau luata na tawi theih kei uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sum na suah ding ua, sum na tawi ding ua, Toupa na Pathian un a mun sehna ah na hoh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na lungsim ua na deihpen uh, bawngtal hiam, belam hiam, uain hiam, zupi hiam, na lungsim ua na lunggulh peuhmah uh adin sum na zang ding ua; huai ah Toupa na Pathian uh ma ah na ne ding ua, kipaktak in na om ding uhi, noute leh na inkawte utoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na tenna ua teng Levite limsaklou in om hetkei un. Na lak uah amau tantuan leh goutan a neikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kum thum a chin kum in huai kum a na thil tung tengteng ua sawm a khat na lakhawm vek ding ua, na omna uah na koih ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na omna ua om Levite leng, na lak ua tantuan, goutan leng neiloute leh gamdang mite leh pa neiloute leh meithaite’n a ne ding ua, a hong khosa thei sam ding uhi. Huchi in Toupa na Pathian un na khut koihna teng uh a vualzawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sagih a chin kum in ngaihdamna na bawl ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngaihdam ding dan hichibang ahi: Leiba neimi peuhmah in a invengte a na leitawi sak a ngaihdam ding uh ahi. A invengte leng, a u a nau leng a sik teitei ding ahi kei. Toupa khahkhiat chih a hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Namdang mi ahihleh na sik teitei thei ding uh. Himahleh nou a bangpeuh na unaute un a na zat uh na ngaihdam ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi zawng himhim na om ding uh ahi kei. Toupa na Pathian un luah dia nou a honpiak gam ah Toupa’n lah hon vualzawl ngei ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hiai thupiak tuni a ka thupiak tengteng zui dia Toupa na Pathian uh phatuamngai tak a na zuih peuhmah uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a honchiam bang in a hon vualzawl dia, nam tampi na leitawi sak ding uh. Nam tampi tung ah vai na hawm ding ua, nou tung ah bel amau vai a hawm kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa’n a hon gam piak na tenna ua na unaute uh lak a mizawng a om uh leh na unau gentheite lak ah na lungsim khauhsak kei unla, sumchit sam kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tung uah na thilphal ngeingei ding ua, a taksap awng hukna khop na leitawisak ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ngaihdam kum, kum sagihna a hongtung dekta, chi in, na unau zawngte mudah a bangmah pe nuamlou in na lungtang uah dikloutak a ngaihtuahna omlou ding in pilvang un.” Huchilou in zaw, amau na tungtang thu uah Toupa a sam ding ua, nou adin khelhna ahi kha ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na piak ngeingei ding uh ahi. Na piak chiang un leng na lungtang uh a nuam mawh ding ahi kei. Huchibang thil ziak in ahi, Toupa na Pathian un na thilhih tengteng uah leh na khut ngakna peuh uh a hon vualzawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai gam ah lah mizawngte omlouh lai omlou ding ahi ngal a. Huaiziak in, Na gam ua na unaute uh tung ah, tasamte tung ah, na mizawngte uh tung ah, na thilphal ngeingei ding uh ahi, chih k’on thupiak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na unau uh, Hebru pa hiam, Hebru nu hiam, na kiang ua a zuak ua, kum guk nangmah na a sep leh kum sagih kum in na khah ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na khah chiang un khutvuak in na pawtsak ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na belamhon ua kipan, na phual ua kipan, na uain sukna khuk ua kipan itlou tak in na pe ding uhi. Toupa na Pathian un a hon vualzawl dan bangzel in na pe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aigupta gam ah sikha na hita ua, Toupa na Pathian un a hon tan chih na theigige ding uh ahi. Huaiziak in ahi, tua hiai thu k’on piak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, noute leh na inkuan uh a ngaih ziak uleh, na kihoutheih ziak ua, “K’on pawtsan kei ding,” a chih bikbek leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />sikzum na la ding ua, kongkhak ah a bil na vut pailet ding ua, huchi in tangtawn in na sikha uh ahi ding. Na sikhanu uh leng huchi mah bang in na hih ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawtsak thil haksa bang in na ngaihtuah ding uh ahi kei. Kiloh sep zahnih sem in kum guk nang na a hon sepsak khinta ngal a. Toupa na Pathian un na thilhih peuh uah a hon vualzawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na ganhonte uh, na belamhonte uh lak a a pa, piang masa pente Toupa na Pathian uh a tuam in na pe ding uhi. Na bawngtal uh a piang masapen nasem ding in na zang ding uh ahi kei. Na belamhonte uh lak a piang masapen mul na met ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh ma ah kum teng in Toupa’n a munseh ding ah nou leh na inkuante utoh na ne ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gensiat kai, a khebai hiam, a mittaw hiam, gensiatna om peuhmah Toupa na Pathian uh kiang a kithoihna ding in na zang ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na omna huangsung ah na ne ding uh ahi. A siangloute leh a siangte’n sangai leh sakhi leng a ne thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A sisan kia na ne ding uh ahi kei. Tui bang in lei ah na sungbua mai ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abib kha tang unla, Toupa Na Pathian uh ading in Paikan Ankuangluina din zang un. Abib kha in ahi, Toupa na Pathian un Aigupta gam apan zana a hon pikhiak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n a min omna mun dia a seh ding ah Toupa na Pathian kiang uah na belamhon lak ua leh na ganhon lak ua Paikan Ankuang ding in na kithoih ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tanghou silngou soh toh na ne ding uh ahi kei. Na damsung teng ua Aigupta gam apan na pawt ni uh na theihgigena ding un ni sagih tanghou silngou sohlouh, haksatna tanghou toh na nekding uh ahi, Aigupta gam apan kintak a pawtkhia na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na gamsung uah ni sagih sung, na lak uah silngou muh in a om ding ahi kei. Ni khat ni nitaklam a na kithoihna sa uh zankhua in a zingsang tan in bangmah a om ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a honpiak na omna uh koilai mah ah Paikan Ankuang kithoih in na kithoih theikei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a min omna mun dia a seh ding kia ah ahi ding. Huai ah Aigupta gam apan na hongpawt hun bang un nitaklam in Paikan Ankuang kithoih in na kithoih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na em ding ua, Toupa’n a munseh ding ah na ne ding ua, zingsang in na pai nawn ding ua, na puanin uah na lut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni guk sung tanghou silngou sohlouh na ne ding uh ahi. A ni sagih ni pen Toupa na Pathian uh ading in khawmpi siangthou ahi dia, nna nasem ding uh ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nipikal sagih na sim ding ua; na buhlak tung ua kipan nipikal sagih na sim ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a hon vualzawl bangzel in na sepkhiak uh lak a noumau utthu a thillat lan in Toupa na Pathian uh ading in nipikal Ankuanglui na nei ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a min omna dia a seh ding ah na sikhanute uh, na tenna ua om Levite, na lak ua om gamdang mite, pa neiloute, meithaite toh Toupa na Pathian uh ma ah kipaktak in na om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aigupta gam ah sikha na hi uh, chih na theihgige ding uh ahi. Hiai dante pilvang tak in na zui ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na buhphual ua kipan leh na uain sukna khuk ua kipan na sekkhawm khit un ni sagih sung bawkta Ankuanglui na nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na Ankuangluina uah nou toh, na tapa utoh, na tanu utoh, na sikhanu utoh, na tenna ua om Levite, gamdang mite, pa neiloute, meithaite toh kipaktak in na om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa’n a munseh ding ah Toupa na Pathian uh ading in ni sagih Ankuang na lui ding uhi. Toupa na Pathian un thiltung tengteng ah leh na khut ngakna tengteng uah a hon vualzawl dia, na vek un kipaktak in na om ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kum teng in na pasal tengteng uh thumvei Toupa ma ah mun a hon sehsak ding ah a kilang ding uh ahi. Tanghou silngou sohlouh Ankuang ah, nipikal Ankuang ah, bawkta Ankuang ah a kilang ding ua, Toupa ma ah kuamah khutvuak in na kilang ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un vualzawlna a hon muhsak bangzel in michih in a zoh hun bang in a pe ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a honpiak kulh kongpi tengteng ah na nam bangzel un vaihawmte leh heutute na kibawl chiat ding ua, mipite vai hoihtak in a hawmsak ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Dikloutakin vai na hawm ding uh ahi kei. Kuamah deihsak tuam na nei ding uh ahi kei. Golhgukna na la ding uh ahi kei. Golhgukna in mipilte mit a tawsak a, mi diktatte thu a kaikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a honpiak gam dam a na luah theihna ding un a dik kia na zui ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh maitam na bawl chiang un a pang ah sing bangchi mah in leng Asher na bawlkhe ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a muhdah lam suang leng na phut ding uh ahi sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawngtal hiam, belam hiam, demna om leh hoihlouhna himhim nei in Toupa na Pathian uh kiang ah na kithoih ding uh ahi kei. Hiai lah Toupa na Pathian uh ading in thil kihhuai ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na lak uah Toupa na Pathian un a honpiak na tenna koipeuh uah leng pasal hiam, numei hiam leng, thukhun bohsia a pathian dang na va sem a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka thupiak louh, ni hiam, kha hiam, van a te himhim hiam, Toupa na Pathian uh mitmuh a thil hoihlou hih a om a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a honhilh ua, nang na zak a, phatuamngai tak a na dot a, ngai in, a dik a, thu a tel mahmah a, huchibang thil kihhuai Israelte lak a hih a na hihleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai thil gilou hihmi, pasal hiam, numei hiam na kulh kongkhak pawlam uah pasal hiam numei hiam pen na pikhe ding ua, suang in na deng lum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Theihpih nih hiam, thum hiam kam apan in a si ding mi hihlup ding ahi. Himahleh theihpih khat kia kam apan in hihlup ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hihlup ding pen tung ah theihpihte’n a khut uh that ding in a kha masa ding ua, huaikhit chiang in mipi tengteng in, huchibang in na lak ua kipan thil hoihlou na hihmang ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sisan kisuah thu ah, sum leh pai thu ah, kivuak thu ah, na tenna ua kiselna thu himhim a nou adia vaihawm haksa lua a hongom leh, Toupa na Pathian un amun seh ding ah na hoh ding ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />huai hun a siampu Levite leh vaihawmte kiang a hoh in na dong ding uhi. Amau thu hihpuk ding dan a hon na kawkmuh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in nou Toupa’n mun a seh ding apan thu hihpuk dan a hon na kawkmuh bang un na hih ding ua, a hon sinsak bang un pilvangtak in na hih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thu hihpuk dan a hon na sinsak uh leh vaihawm dan a hon na hilh bangzel un na hih ding uhi. Thu hihpuk dan a hon na kawkmuh uh taklam ah hiam, veilam ah hiam na pialsan ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh ma a nasem a pang siampu leh vaihawmmi thu pomlou a, engtat peuhmah, huai mi hihlup ding ahi. Israel apan huai thil hoihlou na hihmang ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in mi tengteng in a za ding ua, a lau ding ua, a engtat nawn kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a hon piak ding gam na va tun ua, na va luah ua, na va ten ua, “I gam a nam tengteng bang in kumpipa i nei ding uh, na chih chiang un”;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a telpen kumpipa dia na neih ding uh ahi. Na unau lak ua mi khat na kumpipa ding ua na bawl ding uh ahi. Namdang mi, na unau uh hilou zaw nou hon-uk dia na bawl ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh sakol tampi a kaikhawm ding ahi kei, ahihkeileh sakol zong ding in Aigupta gam a kiknawn din mite a sawl ding ahi kei. A ziak ahihleh Toupa’n , “Huai lam a na kiknawnlouh ding uh ahi” a chi khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A lungtang pimang a a omlouhna ding in zi leng tampi a neih ding ahi kei. Dangka leh dangkaeng leng tampi a khawm ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, a lalgam mangtutphah a a tut chiang in siampu Levite apan kila hiai dan teisawn a, amah adia laibuzial a a gelh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hiai dan amah kiang ah a om gige dia, a damsung teng a, a simzel ding ahi. Huchi in Toupa a Pathian laudan a sinthei dia, hiai danthu tengteng leh danthusehte pilvangtak in a zuithei dia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a unaute tung ah a lungtang a kisathei kei dia, dan apan taklam hiam, veilam hiam ah a pialkei ding hi. Huai nung in a lalgam Israel tung ah amah leh a suante’n sawtpi vai a hawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siampu Levite, Levi nam tengteng in Israelte lak ah tantuan leh goutan a nei ding uh ahi kei. Toupa kiang a mei a thillat leh amau a tuam pen a ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A unaute uh lak ah goutan a nei ding uh ahi kei. A goutan ubel a kiang ua a gen bang in Toupa ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mipite lak apan kithoihna lanpa siampu a tuam ding hiaite ahi: Bawngtal leh belam liang leh a biangtuai lang nih leh a gilpi siampu a piak ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na buh na bal, na uain, na thau tung masate uh, na belam mulmet masak pente uh leng na piak ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un Toupa min a nasem a om tawntung ding in nam tengteng apan amau leh a tapate utoh a tel ahi ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Levi mi kuapeuh a tenna Israel gam na tenna ua a koipeuh pawtsan a, a lungsim a kilawptak a Toupa’n a seh ding mun a a hongpai leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huai a Toupa ma a om Levite, a unaute mah bang in Toupa a Pathian min in na a sem ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A siamput man uh simlouh in midang tuam nek ding a tang sam himhim ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a honpiak ding gamsung a na lut chiang un, huai gam a namte thilhih kihhhuaite zuikei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na lak uah mi kuamah a tapa hiam, a tanu hiam mei a paisuaksak, mi kuamah aisan ching, mi kuamah mangsan ching hiam, bum hiam, mitkhialdawi tawi hiam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zawl aitawi hiam, mi sisa houpih hiam, khate zawl hiam, misisate dong thei hiam na om ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hichibang thilhih chingte peuhmah Toupa adin mi kihhuai ahi ngal ua. Hiai thil kihhuaite ziak in ahi, Toupa na Pathian un amau a hon delh khiak sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh ma a na hoihkim ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huai na valuah ding uh gam a namte’n mitkhialdawi leh aisan chingmite a ngaikhia ua; nou zaw Toupa na Pathian un huchibang hih a hon phalkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un keimah bang na unaute uh lak a mi zawlnei a hon bawlsak dia, a ma thu na ngaikhe ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ Toupa i Pathian aw zaw hon zasak nawn kenla, hiai mei thupi hon musak nawn kenla, ka si kha ding uh” chi a Horeb tang a kikhop khawm ni a Toupa na Pathian uh na deih dan bang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah, a thugen uh a gen hoih ngel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A unaute uh lak ah nangmah bang zawlnei ka bawlsak dia, a kam ah ka thute ka koih dia, a kiang a ka thupiak peuhmah a kiang uah a gen ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, ka min a ka thu a gen zuilou peuhmah ka ngaihtuah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka min a gen ding ka piaklouh gen teitei zawlnei hiam, pathian dangte min a thugenmi zawlnei hiam, huai zawlnei hihlup ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na lungtang ua, bangchi’n ahia a thu Toupa gen ahi kei chih i theih ding? na chih uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zawlnei in Toupa min a thu a gen a, a thilgenpen a hong tangtun kei a, a lohchin kei leh, huaitak ahi, Toupa gen louh. zawlnei in kiuangsaktak in a gen mawkmawk ahi a, amah na lau ding uh ahi kei, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a gam uh nou a honpiak namte Toupa’n a hih manthat khopite na luah ua, a innte ua na ten chiang un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un luah dia nou a hon piakna gam ah nou ading in khopi thum na sep ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huai khopite zotna ding lampite sial unla, Toupa’n a hon luahsak ding gam sehthum suah un. Huchi in mi that kha kuapeuh huaite ah a tailut thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai a tailut mi that kha bitthei ding hiaite ahi: Mi a invengte tuma lam a huatna leng nei khollou a that kha peuh mahte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a invengte toh sing phuk dia gamlak a kuan a sing phuk dia a heipi a sat a, heipi tang kitol in a invengte a denlup khakte ahi ding ua hiai khopite lak a khatpeuh ah a taithei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sisan phulami in a heh na a pailai a mithatmi a delh a, lampi a sau ziak a delhpha in a va satlum kha ding hi. Tuma lam a huatna na nei khollou a hih ziak in sitak ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Khopi thum nou adin na sep ding uh, chi in thu k’on pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un na pi leh pute uh kiang a, a na kichiam bang a na pi leh pute uh piak a na chiam gam a honpiaka;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh it ding leh a lampi zui gige dia, tuni a k’on thupiak tengteng na zuih uh leh hiai khopi thumte simlouh in nou ading in khopi thum dang na behlap nawn ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hiai bel Toupa’n luah dia a honpiak na gam sung ua poikhoih lou sisan suah a omlouh a, na tung ua sisan a omlouhna ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh min a invengte a huat a, a tan a, a sual a, si khophial a a vuak a, huai khopite lak a khat a a tai leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a khaw upate un mi sawl uhenla, huai mipa vapi uhenla, hihlup ding in sisan phulami khut ah pe khia uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amah na hehpih ding uh ahi kei a, nou adia hoih ding in Israel gam apan poikhoih lou sisan suahna na hihmang ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un luah dia a honpiak gam ah a na phuhsa uh na invengte gamgi na suan ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi a thulimlouhna hiam, a khelhna himhim hiam theihpih khat a hun kei dia; theihpih nih kam hiam, theihpih thum kam hiam a thu hihkip ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi khatpeuh thil hihkhial a ngohdia tup gilou nei theihpih mi adin leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />huai bang a kingohna neite gel Toupa ma leh huai hun a siampute leh vaihawmte ma ah ading tuak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vaihawmte’n ngenteltak in thu a dong ding ua, ngai in, theihpihmi thu theihpih zuau a hih a, a unau zuau a ngoh ahihleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a unau tung a hih a tup bangbang amah tung ah na hih ding uh. Huchibang in na lak ua thil hoihlou na hihmang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Midangte’n a za ding ua, a lau ding uh. Huchi in tunung chiang in huchibang thil hoihlou mawngmawng na lak uah a hih nawn kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na hehpih ding uh ahi kei. Hinna tang in hinna, mit tang in mit, ha tang in ha, khut tang in khut, khe tang in khe ahi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na Melmate uh dou dia na kuan ua, sakol, kangtalai, mipi nou sang a tamzaw na muh chiang un, na lau ding uh ahi kei. Aigupta gam apan nou hon pikhepa Toupa na Pathian uh na kiang uah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kidou dia na kuan dek chiang un siampu in mipi vanaih henla, houpih henla, a kiang uah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Israelte aw, za un, tuin na melmate uh dou ding na hi ua, na lungtang uh patau sak kei un. Lau kei unla, ling sam kei un, amaute lauhsak in omkei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Noute hon tonpih a na melmate uh hon dousak a, hon hondam ding Toupa na Pathian uh ahi, chi hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Heutute’n mipite kiang ah, “Inn thak lam a lan nailou na om uhia? A inn ah paikik nawn hen. Kidouna ah a va si kha dia, midang in a lan kha ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Grephuan bawl a, a gah ne nailou na om uhia? A inn ah pai kiknawn hen, kidouna ah a va si kha dia, midang in a ne kha ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Zi kham a kiteng nailou na om uhia? A inn ah pai kiknawn hen. Kidouna ah a va sikha dia, midang in a kitenpih kha ding” chi in gen hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Heutute’n mipite kiang ah, “Lau leh patau na om uhia? A inn ah pai kiknawn hen, a unaute uh lungtang amah lungtang bang in a zulsak kha ding” chilai uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, heutute’n mipite kiang a thu a gen khit un mipite makaih ding sepaih heutute a sep ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dou ding khaw kim na vatun chiang un lemna thu gen phot un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, a hon kileppih ua, a na kihon uleh hichi ahi ding a, huai a mi om tengteng nasem dia na goih ding uh ahi dia, na nna a sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hon kileppih utlou a, a hon na dou ding uleh um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un na khut ua a honpiak hun chiang in pasal tengteng namsau in na thatvek ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Numei leh a ta neu chik chikte uh, gante leh khua a thil omte leh huai a gallak thil tengteng nou a tuam dia na lak ding uh ahi. Toupa na Pathian un a honpiak na melmate uh apan gallak thil na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiai namte khua hilou, na tenna ua kipan a khaw gamla tengteng huchibang in na hihzel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un luah dia a honpiak hiai namte khuate zaw Toupa na Pathian un thu a honpiak bang in a hing peuhmah bangmah na hawi ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hitte, Amorte, Kanante, Perizte, Hivte leh Jebuste na hihmang vek ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A pathiante uh tung a a hih zel uh thil kihhuai tengteng a hon sinsak louhna ding un hihmang vek un. Huchilou in zaw Toupa na Pathian tung ah thil na hihkhial kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lak tuma na dou uh khua sawtpi na um chiang un, a singte uh heipi in na phuk ding uh ahi kei, na nekding uh ahi ngal a. Huai khopi douna a zat ding in leng na phuk ding uh ahi kei, huai gam a singte mihing hinna ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Himahleh gah neilou singte bel phuk in na hihse thei ding ua, na doute khua na lakzoh masiah uh a douna vanzat in na zang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un luah dia a honpiak gamsung a thahsa mi a na om a, a that mi theihlouh ahihleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />na upate uh leh na vaihawmtute uh a hongpai ding ua, a thahna kim khua apan a teh ding ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, a luang apan khaw naipen khua a upate’n bawnghon lak a bawngla, zat nailouh, hakkol paw nailou a kai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai khua upate’n bawngla, tuiluanna, lei lehlouh leh bangmah chinlouhna guam ah a kaisuk ding ua, guam ah a ngawng a tan ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Levi tapa siampute’n a honzuan ding ua, amau Toupa na Pathian un a nasemmi leh Toupa min a vualzawlmi dia a sehte uh lah ahi ngal ua; thubuai leh kivuak thu a gen bangbang uh ahi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Luang naihpen khua upa tengteng in guam a bawngla ngawng a tan tung uah a khut uh a sil ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ka khut un hiai sisan a suahkei a, ka mit un leng a mu sam kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa aw, na tatkhiak, na mi Israelte lak ah poikhoihlou sisan suahna mawh hon khusak ken” chi in a pang ding uhi. Huchi in sisan thu ah ngaihdam ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchibang in Toupa mitmuh a thil hoih hih in poi khoihlou sisan suahna na lak ua kipan na koihmang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na melmate uh dou dia na kipat khiak ua, Toupa na Pathian un na khut ua a honpiak a, sal a na pi ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />sal lak a numei melhoih tak, na mi deihlam, zi dia na mi deihlam tak na muh leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />na inn ah na pi dia; a lu a met dia, a khutchin a tan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A sal puanak a suahkhe dia, na inn ah a om dia, kha khat sung a nu leh a pa a sun dia, huaikhit in, na luppih dia, a pasal na hidia, amah na zi ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amah a kipahna na neih kei leh a ut utna a pai na phal ding ahi, sum leh pai in na zuak ding ahi kei a, sumsinna in na zang ding leng ahi kei, amah na daisakta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Min zi nih nei henla, khat pen deih in khat pen hawta leh, a deihnu leh a huatnu in ta suansak tuakta leh; a upapen a huatnu tapa hita leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a gou neih a tapate a khopsak hun chiang in a deihpen tapa, a tapa upa a huat pen ta sang a deihsakna a piaktuam ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A huat pen ta, a ta upapen, a neih tengteng apan tan nih huai adia a bawl ding ahi; a hatna bul ahi a, tachil hihna a ma a tuam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Min tapa phengphitak, helhattak nei henla, a nu leh a pa thumanglou in, a sawina uh limsakta kei leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a nu leh apan a kai ding ua, a khaw upate uh kiang ah a khaw kulh kongpi bul ah a pi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A khaw upate uh kiang ah, hiai ka tapa uh phengphitak leh helhattak ahi a, ka thu uh leng a mang nuam kei a; kizatbei hat leh khamhat mi ahi, a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in khua a mi tengteng in suang in a denglum ding uhi. Huchibang in na lak ua kipan thil hoihlou na hihmang ding uh ahi. Israel mi tengteng in a za ding ua, a lau ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Min sihna khop khelhna a hih a, thah a om a, singdawn a na khai uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />a luang sing ah zankhua in a om ding ahi kei. Huai ni mahmah in na vui ding uhi. Sing a khai peuhmah lah Pathian hamsethuak ahi ngal a. Toupa na Pathian un luah ding a a honpiak na gam uh na hihnit louhna ding un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na unau bawngtal hiam, a belam hiam mang na muh leh na daih san ding ahi kei. Na unau inn ah na pi ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na unau inn kiang nai a om ahihlouh a, a neimi na theihlouh uh ahihleh, na inn ah na pitou dia, na kiang ah a om nilouh dia, na unau in a zon hunhun in na pe nawn ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in a sabiltung leng na hih ding ahi. Huai mah bang in a puansilh leng na hih ding ahi. Huchi mah bang in na unau thil mansak na muh peuhmah na hih ding ahi, na daihsan mawkmawk ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na unau sabiltung hiam, bawngtal hiam, lampi a puk na muh leh na daihsan maimah ding ahi kei. Na phot pih ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Numei in pasal van a silh ding ahi kei. Pasal in numei van silh ding ahi kei. Kuapeuh huchibang hihmi Toupa Na Pathian uh adin mi kihhuai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lampi a vasabu, sing ah hiam, lei ah hiam, a nou hiam, a tui hiam om, a nou hiam a tui hiam, a pi in a opkhum lai na muh leh a nou a pi toh na lakkhawm ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A pi na khah ngeingei ding ahi. A nou bel na la thei ding hi. Huchi in nang adin a hoih dia, na damsung na sawtsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />inn thak na lam chiang in a tung apan mi kia a, a sisan mawh na khuklouhna din a tung na um ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na grephuan ah thil chi nih na ching ding ahi kei. Huchilou in zaw na chi tuh gah leh na grephuan a gah teng sianglou ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawngtal leh sabiltung lei na kaikhawm sak ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Samul leh pat a gatkhawm puan na silh ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na kituamna puan uh a gei li ah mong khih na bawl ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pasal khat peuh in zi a neih a, a luppih a, a muhdah nawn thepthup a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />hiai numei ka kitenpih a, ka luppih a, nungak siangthou a hihna ka mu kei, chi a zahlaktak a bawl a, a min a hihsiat leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nungak nu leh pa’n kulh kongpi ah huai khaw upate kiang ah nungak siangthou a hih kichetnate a hontawi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nungak pa’n upate kiang ah, “Hiai mipa ka tanu ka neisak a, a haw nawn thepthup hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngai un, Na tanu nungak siangthou a hihna ka mu kei, chi in zahlaktak in a bawl a, himahleh hiaite ka tanu nungak siangthou a hihna ahi” a chi ding hi. Huchi in huai khaw upate ma ah tua puan a phah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai khaw upate’n huai mi paipih in a gawt ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel nungak siangthou a suk minsiat ziak in dangka sekel za khat a liausak ding ua, nungak pa a pe ding uhi, amah zi ahi dia, a damsung in a khen theikei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Himahleh huai mipa thu a na dik a, nungak siangthou a hih kichetnate muh ahihkeileh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />nungak pen apan kongpi ah a pikhe dia, a tenna khua a mite’n amah suang in a denglum ding uh; a pa inn a kizuak a Israelte lak a thil gilou haihuai mahmah a hih ziak in. Huchibang in na lak ua kipan, huai thil hoihlou na hihmang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pasal khat in pasal nei numei a luppih lai muh ahihleh a luppih pasal leh numei a nih ua a sih ding uh ahi. Huchibang in Israel apan huai thil hoihlou na hihmang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nungak siangthou, mi zikham, pasal khat in khopi a a muh a, a luppih leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />a nih un khaw kulh kongpi ah na pikhe ding ua, suang in na denglum ding uh; numei pen khua a om ngal a, a kikou louh ziak in. Pasal pen a invengte zi a hih minsiat ziak in. Huchibang in na lak ua kipan huai thil hoihlou na hihmang ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Himahleh min gamlaka midang in zi dia a khamsa nungak a muh a, a pawngsual leh hiai thilhih pasal kia sihsak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nungak pen bangmah lohlouh ding ahi. Nungak in sihna khop khelhna bangmah hihlou ahi. Hiai bang mi ahihleh min a invengte sual a, that toh kibang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hiai bang thu ahihleh gamlak ah a vatuak kha a, mi zikham nungak a kikou a, panpih ding mi omlou a hih ziak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Min nungak siangthou kuamah khamlouh a muh a, a mat a, a luppih a muh uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />a luppih pasal in nungak pa dangka sekel sawmnga a pe ding ahi. Zi in a nei ding ahi, a hih minsiat tak ziak in. Huchi in a damsung in a khen theikei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pasal in a pa zi a kitenpih ding ahi kei. A pa lupna a buahsak ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chiltang kitam ahihkeileh zahmoh atkhiat mi kuapeuh Toupa mi kikhawmte lak ah a tel ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sawn Toupa mi kikhawmte lak ah a tel ding ahi kei. Suan sawm tan in a suante Toupa mi kikhawmte lak ah a tel ding ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ammonte leh Moabte Toupa mi kikhawmte lak ah a tel ding uh ahi kei. Suan sawmna tan in a lak ua mi Toupa mi kikhawmte lak a, a tel mahmah louh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aigupta gam apan na hong pawtlai ua tanghou leh tui a, a hon na dawnlouh ziak un leh hon hamsiat dia Mesopotamia gam a Pethor khua a Beor tapa Balaam a goih ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa na Pathian un Balaam thu a ngaikhe nuam kei a, Toupa na Pathian un nou a hon it ziak in Toupa na Pathian un huai hamsia nou adin vualzawlna a suaksak zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na damsung teng un a khamuanna ding uh leh a lohchinna ding uh na ngaihtuahpih ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Edomte na kih ding uh ahi kei, na unaute uh lah ahi ngal ua. Aigupta mite na kih ding uh ahi kei, a gam ua mikhual na hihtak ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A suan uh thumna apan Toupa mi kikhawmte lak ah a tel ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na melmate uh dou dia giahphual na sat chiang un thil sianglou chiteng apan na kihuikhiak ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na lak ua kuapeuh zan chiang a amah apan bawtui pawt ziak a thanghuai na om uleh, giahphual apan a pawt dia, giahphual ah a lutnawn ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh ni a hong kai chiang in, a kisil dia; nitum chiang in giahphual ah a lut nawn ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Giahphual pawlam ah zun leh ek thakna ding mun na sep ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na vanzat lak uah ninluahna na nei ding ua; hichi ahi ding a, na dailen chiang un, huai in lei na khuak ding ua, zun leh ek na thak uh na vuk nawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un lah na giahphual uah nou hon humbit ding leh na melmate uh honpe din a hongtel ngal a. Huaiziak in, na giahphual uh a siangthou ding ahi. Huchilou in zaw na lak ua thil sianglou a mu dia, a hon paimangsan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na kiang ua sikha, a pu hon taikhiak san na pe kiknawn ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na omna ua a deihpen a tel peuhpeuh ah na lak uah a omsam ding ahi. Amah na nuaisiah ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel tanute lak ah kizuak a om ding ahi kei a, Israel tapate lak ah leng pasal kizuak a om ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kizuak man hiam, tawkaw man hiam thuchiamna din Toupa na Pathian inn ah na tawi ding uh ahi kei. Toupa na Pathian uh adin thil kihhuai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A pung delh in na unau na leitawisak ding ahi kei. Dangka lam a pung hiam, nekding lam a pung hiam, bangpeuh a pung delh a leitawisak louh ding ahi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gamdang mite bel a pung delh in na leitawi sak thei ding uh. Himahleh na unaute a pung delh in na leitawi sak ding ahi kei. Huchi in na va luah ding uh gam a na khut ngakna tengteng uah Toupa na Pathian un a hon vualzawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh kiang a thu na chiam un sawt hallou in na pepah ding uh ahi. Toupa na Pathian un lah hon phutngei ding ahi ngal a. Khial in na mawh kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuchiam lam a na kidek uleh nou adin khelhna ahi kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na kam ua pawtsa na hih ding uh ahi: Ut thu a thillat na kam ua na chiam uh Toupa na Pathian uh kiang a na chiam bang ua na lat pah ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na invengte grephuan a na hoh chiang un na deih zah uh na ne ding ua, himahleh na seng ua na guanlouh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na invengte buh ding lai mun a na hoh chiang un a vui na khiakthei ding uh. Himahleh na invengte buh ding lai ah kawite na zang ding uh ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasal khat in zi a neih a, amah a sianglou banghiam khat a muh ziak a a lungtun kei leh hichi ahi dia, kimakna lai a gelhsak dia, a pedia, a inn apan a pawtsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A inn apan a pawt nung in midang a vanei thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pasal nanungpen in a zakdah a, kimakna lai a gelhsak a, a piak a, a inn apan a pawtsak hiam, a pasal nanung zaw, zi a neipa a si hiam ahihleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a pasal masa, amah paisakpa’n a hih nitsa ahi a, a nei nawn theikei ding. Toupa mitmuh in hiai thil kihhuai ahi. Toupa’n luah dia a honpiak gam ah khelhna na lutsak ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasal zi nei tung sepaih in a kuan ding ahi kei a, bang nasem dia phut ding leng ahi kei. A inn ah kum khat zalen in a om dia, a zi lungnuam tak in a omsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Buh gawizanna hiam, a tunglam suang hiam kichiamna ding in kuamah apan na lentang ding uh ahi kei; mi hinna lettang sak na hi ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kuapeuh, Israel suan, a unaute lak a mi gu a, sal a zat hiam, zuak hiam theihkhiak ahihleh huai gutapa hihlup ding ahi. Huchibang na lak ua kipan thil hoihlou na hihmang ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Phak hipi tung tang thu ah hoihtak a ettel a, siampu, Levite sinsak dan bangzel a hih din pilvang un. Amau thu ka piak bang in pilvang tak in na hih ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aigupta gam apan na hong pawtna lampi a Toupa na Pathian un Miriam tung a a hih dan theigige un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangpeuh na invengte uh na leitawi sakleh a khamna la din a inn ah na lut ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />inn pua ah na ding dia, leitawi sakmi in tua khamna inn pua ah a hon tawikhe ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi zawng ahihleh a khamna kem in na giahpih ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bang teng hileh nitum chiang in a kichiamna thil a kiang ah pekik in. Huchi in a puantual silh in a ihmu thei dia, nang a hon phatthei ding hi. Huai khamna thilpen na Pathian ma ah nang ading in diktatna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na mi goih, mi genthei leh tasam na unau hiam, na gam ua na tenna ua om gamdang mi hiam leng hita leh na simmawh ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A sep ni’n a loh na pe ding uh; ni’n a tumkhum ding ahi kei. Mizawng ahi a, huai ah a lungtang a koih hi. Huchilou in zaw na tungtang uah Toupa a sam dia, nou adin khelhna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tate ziak in pate hihlup ding ahi kei a, pate ziak in tate leng hihlup ding ahi sam kei. Michih amah khelhna ziak a hihlup ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gamdang mite leh pa neiloute dikloutak a na gensak ding ahi kei. Meithai puan leng khamna din na laksak ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nou leng Aigupta gam ah sikha na hi ngeita ua, Toupa na Pathian un huai apan a hontat na hi uh, chih na theihgige ding uh ahi. Huchi in Toupa na Pathian un na khutngakna chiteng uah a hon vualzawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na lou ua buh na lak un, buhphal na khop maih uleh na lak nawn ding uh ahi kei. Gamdang mite, pa neiloute, meithaite ading ahi. Huchi in Toupa na Pathian un na khut koihna tengteng uh a vualzawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na Olive sing uh na sat chiang un a hiangte na sat ding uh ahi kei. Gamdang mite, pa neiloute leh meithaite ading ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na grephuan ua na loh chiang un a sang na zong ding uh ahi kei. Gamdang mite, pa neiloute leh meithaite ading ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aigupta gam ah sikha na hita uh, chih na theigige ding uh ahi. Huaiziak in, ahi, hiai thilhih dia thu k’on piak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi a kinak ua, vaihawmna mun a a hoh uleh, vaihawmte’n a na gensak ding ua, mi diktat siam a tangsak ding ua, migilou mawh a tangsak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, migilou zep tuakmah ahihleh, vaihawm min a lumsak dia, a ma ah a zep ding ahi. A gitlouh dungzui a zep ding zah bikhiah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sawmli vei tan zep theih ahi dia, huai val zaw hilou in. Hiai sang a val a zep leh na unaupa uh na zahlaksak lawkha ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawngtal in buh a chil lai in a muk na gak ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Unaute teng khawm uhenla, tapa neilou in a lak ua khat si leh, a sipa zi in pawlam a midang a kitenpih ding ahi kei. A pasal unaupa in a luah dia, zi in a nei dia, a pasal unau mohpuakna tung ah a hih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, a tachil suansak in Israel lak a, a min a manlouhna din a unau sip a min a pu ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman a unaupa zi kitenpih a utkei leh, a unaupa zi kulh kongpi a upate kiang ah a hohtou dia, “Ka pasal unaupa’n Israel lak a a unaupa min omsak zel a utkei a, ka pasal unaupa hih ding ka tung ah a hih nuam kei” a va chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in a khaw upate un amah a sam ding ua, a houpih ding ua aman, “Ka kitenpih nuam kei” chi a apan leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A unaupa zi a kiang ah upate ma ah a hong dia, upate ma a va naihtou dia, a khedap a suahsak dia, a mai ah a chil a se ding hi. “A unaupa inkuan khotuah nuam loupa tung ah hichibang a hih hi ngeingei hen” a chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in, inkuan khedap suahsakpa, chi in Israelte lak ah a min putsak ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi kilai uhenla, a khat penpa zi in a kilaih pihpa apan a pasal hon khe din a zahmoh kaihsakta leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a khut na tansak ding uh ahi. Na hehpih ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na ipsung uah bukna suang chi tuamtuam, a gik leh a zang na nei ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na inn uah tehna chi tuamtuam, a lian leh a neu na kem ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bukna diktak leh hoihtak na nei ding uh ahi. Tehna diktak leh hoihtak na nei ding uh ahi. Huchi in Toupa’n a hon gam piak ah na damsawt ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchibang hihmi, diktatlou tak a hih tengteng Toupa na Pathian un a kih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aigupta gam apan na hong pawtna lampi ua Amalekte’n a hon na bawl dan uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian leng lau lou a, na bahlai uh leh na nguailai ua lampi a hon kituahpih a, na lak ua a nanungpente, na nunglam ua hatloute, na bahlai leh na gimlai ua a hon na sualdante uh theigige un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huaiziak in hichi ahi ding a, Toupa na Pathian un luahdia gam a honpiak chiang in, na kim ua na melma tengteng ua pan Toupa na Pathian un galmuanna a honpiak chiang in van nuai a Amalekte theihgigena na hihmang sipsip ding uhi. Na mangngilh ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan hichi ahi ding a, Toupa na Pathian un gouluah dia gam a honpiak na va lut ua, na vaten chiang un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a honpiak na gam leigah tung masapen chiat uh na hontawi ding ua; bawm ah na koih ding ua, Toupa na Pathian un a min omsakna dia a seh ding ah na hoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huai hun a siampu kiang ah na hoh ding ua, a kiang ah, honpiak dia i pi leh pute kiang a, a chiamna gam ka hongtungta uh, chih tuni in Toupa na Pathian uh kiang ah i hihlang uhi, na chi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siampu in na khut ua kipan bawm a la dia, Toupa na Pathian uh maitam bul ah a nga ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nou Toupa na Pathian uh ma ah, “Ka pu uh Suria mi, mi vakvai ahi a, Aigupta gam ah a paisuk a, a vateng a, tawmchik ahi ua; huai ah nam thupitak, thilhihtheitak, tamtak a hong hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aigupta mite’n a hon simmawh ua, a hon hihgenthei ua, nasep haksa pipi a hon semsak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa i pi leh pute Pathian i sam ua, Toupa’n i aw uh a naza a, i gentheih dan, i gim dan, leh nuaisiah a i omdan a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n Aigupta gam apan khut hattak, banzak, thillauhuai tak, chiamtehnate leh thillamdangte in a hon pikhia a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />hiai mun ah a hon pilut a, hiai gam, nawitui leh khuaizu luanna gam a honpia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngai in, Toupa aw, nang na honpiak leigah masapen chiatte ka hontawi uhi” na vachi ding uhi. Toupa na Pathian uh ma ah na vual ding ua, Toupa na Pathian uh bia in na kun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un na inkuante, noute, Levi mite, na lak ua gamdang mite thil hoih a honpiak tengteng ah kipaktak in na om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kum thum kum, sawm a khat piak kum a na thil tung tengteng uh sawm a khat na piakkhit uleh, Levi mite, gamdang mite, pa neiloute, meithaite’n na omna uah a ne ding uh, a hong khosak theih samna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh ma ah, thu na honpiak tengteng bang in ka inn ua kipan thil siangthoute ka sepkhia ua, Levi mite, gamdang mite, pa neiloute leh meithaite ka peta uh. Na thupiak a koi mahmah ka bohse kei ua, ka mangngilh kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka dahlai un huai ka ne kei ua, ka sian louhlai un ka thehthang sam kei ua. Misi tuam adin leng ka pe kei uhi. Toupa ka Pathian uh aw ka dawp ua, n’on thupiak tengteng bang in ka hih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na omna siangthou van apan hon en inla, nawitui leh khuaizu luanna gam, ka pi uh leh pute piak dia na kichiamsa bang in na mi Israelte leh na gam honpiak vualzawl in, na chi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuni in Toupa na Pathian un hiai dan leh vaihawmte zui ding in thu a honpia hi. Huaiziak in, na lungtang tengteng uh leh na lungsim tengteng ua pom in na zui ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuni in Toupa lampite zui a, a dante, a thupiakte leh a vaihawmte zui a, a aw dawptum in na Pathian ding un na telta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thu a hon chiamsa bang in leh a thupiak tengteng na zuihna ding un Toupa’n tuni in amah a tuambik hi ding in nou a hon na telta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A na gensa bang a Toupa na Pathian uh adia a Mi Siangthou na hihtheihna ding un leh nam a bawl tengteng tung a phat, min hoih, leh pahtawi a na om theihna ding un, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan Mosi leh Israel upate’n mipite thu a pia ua, tuni a k’on piak thupiak tengteng zui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a hon gam piak a lut dia Jordan na kan ni chiang un hichi ahi dia, suang liantakte na phut ding ua, suanglou na nuh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na galkah khit chiang un a tung uah hiai danthu tengteng na gelh ding uh ahi. Huchi in Toupa , na pi leh pute uh Pathian in a hon na chiamsa bang in nawitui leh khuaizu luanna gam, Toupa na Pathian un a honpiak gam ah na paithei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jordan lui na galkah khit chiang un hichi ahi ding a, tuni a k’on thupiak bang in Ebal tang ah suangte na phut ding ua, suanglou na nuh ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai ah Toupa na Pathian uh ading in maitam, suang maitam na bawl ding uh ahi. Vanzat ding in sik na zang ding uh ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh maitam suang seklouh in na bawl ding uh ahi. Huai ah Toupa na Pathian uh adin haltum thillatte na lan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kilepna thillatte in na kithoih ding ua, huai ah na ne ding ua, Toupa na Pathian uh ma ah kipaktak in na om ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Suangte ah hiai danthu tengteng teltak in na gelh ding uh ahi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mosi leh siampu Levite’n Israel mi tengteng a houpih ua, Israel mite aw, hoihtak in ngaikhia un. Tuni in Toupa na Pathian uh mite na hong hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Toupa na Pathian uh thu na zuih ding uh ahi. Tuni a k’on thupiakte leh a dante na zuih ding uh ahi, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai ni mah in Mosi in mipite thu a pia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jordan luigal na kahkhit chiang un mipite vualzawl ding in Gerizim tang ah hiaite adin ding uh ahi: Simeon nam, Levi nam, Judah nam, Issakar nam, Joseph nam leh Benjamin nam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hamsiat ding in hiaite Ebal tang ah adin ding uh ahi: Reuben nam, Gad nam, Asher nam, Zebulun nam, Dan nam leh Naphtali nam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Levite’n a hon gen pan ua, Israel mi tengteng kiang ah aw ngaihtak in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Khutsiamte khutsuak Toupa adia kihhuai milim tunkhiak tawm hiam, gukkep peuhmah hamsethuak in om hen” a chi ding ua, mipi tengteng in, “Amen” chi in a na dawng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“A nu hiam, a pa hiam zahtaklou peuhmah hamsethuak in om hen” a chi ding ua, mipi tengteng in, “Amen!” a na chi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“A invengte gamgi suan mi hamsethuak in om hen” a chi ding ua, mipi tengteng in, “Amen!” a na chi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Lampi apan mittaw lampi lou a paisak mi hamsethuak in om hen” a chi ding ua, mipi tengteng in, “Amen!” a na chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Gamdang mi, pa neilou leh meithai vai dikloutak a hawmsak mi hamsethuak in om hen” a chi ding ua, mipi tengteng in, “Amen!” a na chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“A pa zi luppih mi hamsethuak in om hen” a pa niklem a hih ziak in, a chi ding ua, mipi tengteng in, “Amen!” a na chi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Bang gan peuhpeuh luppih mi hamsethuak in om hen” a chi ding ua, mipi tengteng in, “Amen!” a na chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“A sanggamnu, a pa tanu hiam, a nu tanu hiam, luppih mi hamsethuak in om hen” a chi ding ua, mipi tengteng in, “Amen!” a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“A sungnu luppih mi hamsethuak in om hen” a chi ding ua, mipi tengteng in, “Amen!” a na chi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“A invengte gukthah mi hamsethuak in om hen” a chi ding ua, mipi tengteng in, “Amen!” a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Poikhoihlou thahna dia golhna lami hamsethuak in om hen” a chi ding ua, mipi tengteng in, “Amen!” a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Hiai danthute zui dia pom kiplou mi hamsethuak in om hen” a chi ding ua, mipi tengteng in, “Amen!” a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan hichi a honghi ding a, Toupa na Pathian aw hoihtak a na ngaihkhiak ua, tuni a thu ka honpiak, thupiak tengteng pilvangtak a na zuih uleh, Toupa na Pathian un khovel nam tengteng a tungnungpen in a honbawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh thu na zuih peuhmah uleh hiai vualzawlna tengteng na tung uah a hongtung dia, a honzui ding uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Inlam leh gam lam ah vualzawl in na om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na gil ua gah, na lei ua gah, na ganhon, na bawngpi leh na belamhon uh vualzawl in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na bawm uh leh na tanghou mekna kuangte uh vualzawl in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vakkhete vualzawl in na om ding ua, in a honglutte leng vualzawl in na om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na melma nou hondoute Toupa’n a hon zohsak dia; nou hondou din lampi khat ah a hong kuan ding ua, lampi sagih ah a taikek ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n na buhin tung uah, na khut koihna tengteng uah vualzawlna thu a pedia; Toupa na Pathian un a hon gam piak ah a hon vualzawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na kiang ua a na kichiam bang in Toupa’n amah adin nam siangthou ding in a hon hihkip ding, Toupa na Pathian uh thupiakte na zuih ua, a lampite na zuih phot uleh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in khovel namchih in Toupa min a sap na hi uh, chih a thei ding ua, a hon lau ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nou piak dia na pi leh pute uh Toupa’n a na chiam gam ah na gil ua gah, na ganhon gah leh na leigah uh Toupa’n nakpitak in a pungsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n a hun geihgeih in na gam uh vak ding, vuahtui honpe ding leh na khut koihna tengteng uh hon vualzawl ding in, a van goubawm hoih a kihongsak ding hi. Huchi in nam tampi na leitawi sak ding ua, nou bel na leitawi kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa’n a mei hilou in, a lu in a honbawl dia, a nuai nung hilou in, a tung nung na hi ding uhi. Toupa na Pathian uh thupiak, tuni a ka honpiak ngaikhia a, pilvangtak a na zuih uleh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A thute a bang mahmah taklam hiam, veilam hiam a pathian dangte zui leh nasem dia na pialsan kei peuhmah uleh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh hichi a honghi ding a, Toupa na Pathian uh aw hoihtak a na ngaihkhiak louh ua, tuni a k’on piak thupiak tengteng pilvang tak a na zuihkei uleh, hiai hamsia tengteng na tung uah a hongtung dia, a hon phanawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Inlam leh gam lam ah hamsia na thuak ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na bawm uh leh na tanghou mekna kuang uh hamsethuak in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na gilgahte, na leigahte leh na bawngpi uh leh na belamhon gahte hamsethuak in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na pawtkhete uh hamsethuak in a om ding ua, a honglutte leng hamsethuak in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa’n na tung uah, na khut koihna tengteng uah hamsia, buaina leh salhna a honsawl dia, na vuallel ding ua, na mangthang pah ding uh; na thilhih giloute ua kei n’on paisan ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Luah dia na lutna gam ua kipan a honhih manthat masiah Toupa’n hipi na lak uah a lengsak gige ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa’n kumzawnna, khosik, bawkna, sat huthutna, namsau, keuna leh muatna in a hon gawt dia, na manthat vek masiah uh hiaite’n a hon delh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na lu tung ua van dal ahi dia, na nuai ua lei sik ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Toupa’n na gam vuah uh leivui leh vut a suaksak dia; na manthat masiah uh van apan na tung uah a hong ke ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Toupa’n na melmate uh lak ah a hon hihniam dia; amaute dou din lampi khat ah na kuankhe ding ua, lampi sagih ah na taikek ding uh. Khovel a namchih lak ah tuahkhiat in na om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na luang uh tungleng vasa tengteng leh gamsa tengteng nekding an ahi dia, mi kuamah in amaute a delhmang kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hihdam theihlouh Aigupta meimatum, chithak, bawkna leh vunthak in Toupa’n a hon gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Haina, mittawtna leh lunglelhna in Toupa’n a hon gawt ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mittaw in khomial a maimai bang in, sun khovak nasan ah na maimai ding ua, na khosakna uah na lamzang kei ding uh. Nuaisiah ding leh gallak ding phet na hi ding ua, hon hunkhe ding kuamah a omkei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zi na kham ding ua, midang in a luppih ding uh. Inn na lam ding ua, na luahkei ding uh. Grephuan na bawl ding ua, a gah na nekei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na mit muh un na bawngtal uh a hon gohsak ding ua, a sa na nekei ding uh. Na mitmuh un na sabiltung uh thagum a suhsak na hi ding ua, piakkik na hi kei ding uh. Na belam uh na melmate uh piak ahi ding; hon hun khe ding kuamah na neikei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Na tanute uh leh na tapate uh namdangte piak ahi ding ua, nitum in amau ngai in na en vungvung ding ua, na et etna lam un na mitte uh a vai ding; bangmah lah hihtheih na neikei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na leigah, na sepkhiat teng uh na theihlouh uh nam in a ne khin dia, hihgentheih leh hihsiat in na om gige ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Huchi in hiai thil mu in na hailoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Toupa’n na khuk uah, na khe uah, hihdam theihlouh meimatum a hon veisak ding, na khepek ua kipan na lusip tanpha un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nou leh na kumpipa uh nangawn in na pi leh pute’n a theih ngeilouh uh nam kiang ah Toupa’n a honpi dia; huai ah pathian dangte, sing leh suang pathiante nna nasem ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Toupa’n a hon pimang na ding nam tengteng lak ah lamdang chih leh paunak leh a selam a gentehna na honghi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Lou ah buhchi tampi na kuankhiak pih ding ua, tawmchik kia na la ding uh, khaupe in a negai vek ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Grephuan na bawl ding ua, na kem ding ua, himahleh a uain na dawn kei ding uh. Grep lah na lou kei ding uh, lung in a negai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Na gam tengteng uah olive sing na suan ding ua, himahleh a thau na nilh kei ding uh, na olive gahte uh a pulh khin ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tanu tapa na suang ding ua, himahleh sal a kaihmang a, a om ding ziak un na ompih khakei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Na theikung tengteng uh leh na leigah tengteng uh khaupe an ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Gamdang mi na lak ua tengte na tung uah a sang hiaihiai ding ua, nou na niam giaigiai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A hon leitawisak ding ua, nou zaw na leitawisak kei ding uh. Amau a lu ahi ding ua, nou a mei na hi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hiai hamsia tengteng na tung uah a hongtung dia, a hondelh dia, a honpha dia; hih manthat a na om masiah uh; a thupiak leh a dan honpiak zui dia Toupa na Pathian aw na ngaihsaklouh ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Na tung uah leh na suante uh tung ah tangtawn a dia chiamtehna leh lamdang chih ding in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Thil bangkim a na hong kiningchin ua leng Toupa na Pathian uh lungsim kipaktak leh nuamsatak a nasep saklouh ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Huaiziak in, nou hondou dia Toupa’n a honsawl ding na melmate uh gilkial, dangtak leh vuaktang leh thil bangkim tasam kawm in na sepsak ding uh. A hon hihsiat masiah uh na ngawng uah sik hakkol a hon batsak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Gamlapi apan kawlmong apan nou hondou ding nam, Toupa’n muvanlai ngamkiak bang in a honsawl ding; a pau uh na theihlouh uh nam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />nam lauhuai melpu, upa leng khawksalou leh tuailaite leng deihsak tuamlou.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Na ganhon pungte leh na leigah, na manthat masiah uh a ne ding ua, buh, uain, thau, na bawnghon leh na belamhonte uh a hawikei ding uh, na tung ua manna a hon tunsak tan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Na gam tengteng ua na muanpen uh, na kulhsangte uh a chip tan in na kulh kongpi tengteng uah a hon um ding ua, Toupa na Pathian un nou a honpiak na gam tengteng ua na kulh kongpi tengteng uh a hongum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Na melmate’n a hon um bichilh ziak un leh a hon khelh chipna uah na gil ua gah, Toupa’n a honpiak na tanu, na tapate sa na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Na lak ua mi nunnem leh chingkam nangawn in leng a unaupa, ahihkeileh a zi it, a ompihlai a tate ngialtak leng a it kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Bangmah a neih nawnlouh ziak in a tate uh sa a nekding kuamah a pekei ding hi. A hon umna uh leh a hon khelh chipna uah, na melmate’n na kulh kongpi ua a hon khelhchip ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Na lak ua numei chinou leh chingek, a chinouna leh a chingekna ziak a lei leng sik nuamlou in a pasal deih mahmah uh, a tapate, a tanute;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />a pomlai a tasen leh a ta pianglai ding leng a en mawh ding uh. Bangkim a taksap khit ziak in a simnek ding; na melmate’n na kulh kongpi ua a hon khelhchip ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh min thupitak leh lauhuaitak na lauh theihna ding ua, hiai laibu a tuang thu tengteng pilvang tak a na zuihkei uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Toupa’n noute leh na suante uh tung ah hipi lamdangtak, hipi leng gige, damlouhna haksatak leng gige chi a lengsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Na lauh mahmah uh Aigupta gam hite na tung uah a lengsak nawn dia, a hon lenkip ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Hiai dan laibu a tuanglou, damlouhna hi chiteng leng na manthat masiah uh Toupa’n na tung uah a lengsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Van a aksi zah hita noute tawmchik kia na hong hita ding uh; Toupa na Pathian aw na manlouh ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, hon hihhoih ding leh hon pungsak dia Toupa na tung ua a kipah bang in, hon hihmang ding leh bangmahlou honsuah din Toupa na tung uah a kipak dia, na valuah ding uh na lutna gam ua kipan suanmang na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Toupa’n kawlmong apan kawlmong langkhat tan in chichih lak ah a hon hihdalh dia, huai ah sing leh suang, na pi uh leh pute uh tan a na theih ngeilouh uh pathian dangte nna nasem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Huai nam lak ah tawldamna na mu kei ding ua, na khe ua din khawlna a omkei dia; huai ah, Toupa’n lungtang ling, mit gim leh lungsim ngui a hon pezaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Na hinna uh lauthawng gige in a om dia, sun leh zan in lau gige in na om ding ua, na hinna un kitheihchetna a neikei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Zingsang in, “Nitak hita leh aw!” na chi ding ua, nitakin, “Zingsang hita leh aw!” na chi ding uh; thil lauhuai na lungtang un a lauh ding ziak leh na mit ua na thilmuh ding uh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Na mu nawn kei ding uh, na kiang ua ka chih lampi ah long in Aigupta gam ah Toupa’n a hon pinawn ding. Huai ah na melmate uh sikkhapa ding leh sikhanu dia zuak na hi ding ua, kuamah in a hon leikei ding uh, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Horeb tang a a kiang ua thu a khun simlouh, Toupa’n Moab gam a Israel suante kiang a Mosi thu a khunsak, a thukhun thu hiaite ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mosi in Israel mi tengteng a sam a, a kiang uah, Aigupta gam a Pharo, a sikha tengteng leh a gam tengteng tung a na mitmuh ngei ua Toupa’n thil a hih tengteng na mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khemna thupi mahmahte, chiamtehnate leh thillamdangte na mit mahmah ua na muh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa’n tunitan in theisiam ding lungtang, mu thei ding mitte, za thei ding bilte a honpe naikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gamdai ah kum sawmli ka honpi a; na puansilhte uh na silh tul kei ua, na khedapte uh leng na buntul kei lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei, Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi, chih na theihna ding un tanghou na nekei ua, uain hiam zu khauh hiam leng na dawn kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hiai mun na hongtun un Heshbon kumpipa Sihon leh Bashan kumpipa Og hondou din a hong kuan ua, amau i na zou uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A gam uh i la ua, Reubente, Gadte, Manasseh nam kimkhatte luah din i pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na thilhih tengteng ua na lamzan zel theihna ding un hiai thukhun thute pom unla, zui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuni in na vek un, na nam lupente uh, na upate uh, na heutute uh leh Israelmi tengteng, Toupa na Pathian ma ah na ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />na ta neute uh, na zite uh, na tenna ua gamdang mi na om pih uh, na singphukmi uh leh na tuitawi mite uh nangawn in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh kichiamna leh a thukhun tuni a nou toh a bawl a na lut theihna ding un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na pipute uh Abraham, Isak leh Jakob kiang a a na kichiam bang leh na kiang ua a na gensa bang a a mite hidia tuni a a hon hihkip theihna ding leh na Pathian uh a hihtheihna ding in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hiai kichiamna leh thukhun na kiang kia ua khung ka hi kei;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tuni a Toupa i Pathian uh ma a dingte leh tua i kiang ua om loute kiang ah leng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aigupta gam a i omdan, namdangte pal paisuak a i paidan bang uh na thei ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a lak ua a thil kihhuaite uleh a milimte uh, sing leh suang, dangka chi leh dangkaeng leng na mu uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchilou in zaw na lak ua pasal hiam, numei hiam, inkuan hiam, nam hiam, huai pathiante be din a lungtang un tuin Toupa i Pathian uh kiheisan in, na lak uah thil kha leh gamsai selkhiakna bulte na hongom kha ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi ahihleh zaw, hiai hamsia thusamte a zaktak in, amah ki vualzawl tawm in “Paupeng in pai teitei leng le ka bit na ding” chi in a kingaihtuah kha ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa’n a ngaidam hetkei dia, Toupa hehna leh a mullitna in huai mi a khuh dia, hiai laibu a hamse tuang tengteng a tung ah a tung dia, Toupa’n van nuai apan a min a thaimang zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hiai dan bu a tuang hamsia thukhun tengteng bang in Israel nam tengteng lak apan hihtuam in thil hoihlou lam ah Toupa’n a khenkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khangthak hongom ding, nanung ua na tate uh hongom ding leh gam gamlapi apan a hongpai dingte’n, huai gam a hipi leh Toupa’n natna a veisakte a mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A gam pumpi mei kat siat leh chi leh kat a dim, haichi lah kipawi lou, bangmah pou lou, sing leh lou mah bang omlou hi ding. Toupa heh leh thangpaihna Sodom leh Gomorrah, Admah leh Zeboim a lumlet lai a siatna bangmah ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Nam teng in bangziak in ahia hiai gam hichitel a Toupa’n a bawl? Hiai thangpaihna thupi bangchi dan ahia?” a chi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mite’n, “Aigupta gam apan a pikhiak lai a Toupa , a pipute uh Pathian thukhun amau toh a khun a mangngilh ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />pathian dangte, a theih ngeilouh uh pathiante, aman a sehsak louhte na sem a, a biak ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hiai laibu a tuang hamsia tengteng tungsak din hiai gam tung ah Toupa a heh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thangpai, heh leh thangpai mahmah in a gam ua kipan a botkhe vek a, gamdang ah a sawnlut hi, tua a omdan bang uh” a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thil kiselte Toupa i Pathian a ahi, thil hihlatte bel hiai danthu tengteng i zuih theihna dia eite leh i suante a ahi gige ding ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi ding a, hiai thil tengteng na ma ua ka omsak, vualzawlna leh hamsiate na tung ua a hongtun a, Toupa’n a hon delh zakna nam tengteng lak a na theih khiak nawn ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian lam na ngat nawn ua, tua thu k’on piak bang a nou leh na tate utoh na lungtang tengteng uh leh na lungsim tengteng ua a aw na zuih hun chiang un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un na salhihna uh a hihmang dia, a hon hehpih dia, Toupa na Pathian un namchih lak a a hon dalhsakna apan a hon pikhawm nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na lak ua mi van tawppha a delhkhiak a om uleh, Toupa na Pathian un huai apan a hon pikhawm ding, huai apan a hon pikhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un na pi leh pute un a luah gam ah a hon pilut nawn dia, na luah ding uh. Aman a hon lamzang sak dia, na pi leh pute uh khup in a hon pungsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na hin theihna ding ua Toupa na Pathian uh na lungtang tengteng uh leh na lungsim tengteng ua na it theihna ding un, Toupa na Pathian un na lungtang uh leh na suante lungtang a hon sumsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un hiai hamsia tengteng a hon simmawhte, na melmate uh leh a hon hawte tung ah a tungsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na hong kihei nawn ding ua, Toupa aw na zui ding ua, tuni a thu k’on piak, a thupiak tengteng na zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un na khutngakna tengteng uah, na gil ua gah ah, na ganhon gah uah leh na gam gah uah hoih a tungsak dia, na pi leh pute uh tung a a kipah bang in na tung uah Toupa a kipak nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hiai dan bu a tuang a thupiakte, a dante zui dia Toupa aw na zuih ua, na lungtang tengteng uh leh na lungsim tengteng ua Toupa na Pathian uh lam na ngat phot uleh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hiai thupiak, tua k’on piak nou adin a haksa law kei a, gamlat leng a hon gamlat kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I zak ua i zuih theihna din, “Kua ahia van a hon kahsak a, hon laksak ding?” chih din van a om ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I zak ua i zuih theihna din tuipi gal ah “Kuan ahia hon va hohsak dia, hon laksak ding?” chih din tuipi gal a om leng ahi sam kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na zuih theihna ding un thu in a honnaih mahmah a, na kam uh leh na lungtang uah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuin na ma uah hinna leh hoih, sihna leh hoihlou ka koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh it ding, a lampi zui ding, a thupiak, a dan, a vaihawm, zui dia tua k’on thupiak na zuih uleh na hing ding ua, na hongpung ding ua, na valuah ding gam ah Toupa na Pathian un a hon vualzawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh na lungtang uh a ki heimang a, na ngaihkhiak kei ua, pimang a na om ua, pathian dangte na biak ua, a na uh na sep uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />na mangthang ngeingei ding uh, chih tuin k’on hilh ahi. Jordan lui kan a, luah dia na va lutna gam ah na damsawt kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na ma uah hinna leh sihna, vualzawlna leh hamsia ka koih chih tu a hon theihpih ding in lei leh van ka sam ahi. Huchi in hinna tel un, na hinna ding un nou leh na suante uh toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh it in, a aw zui in, amah len chinten un, amah na hinna uh, na damsawtna uh lah ahi ngal a. Huchi in na pu uh Abraham, Isak leh Jakob kiang a kichiam a piak gam ah na teng ding uhi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Mosi in, Israel mite teng kiang ah hiai thu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tuin kum za leh sawmnih ka hita a; ka vialvak zou nawn kei. Toupa’n ‘hiai Jordan lui na kan kei ding,’ a honchi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un na ma uh a pi dia, hiai namte a hon hihsiat sak dia, a gam uh na luah ding uh. Toupa’n a na gensa bang in Joshua in na ma uh a pi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa’n Amorte kumpipa, Sihon leh Og leh a gam tung ua a hih bang in a tung uah a hih dia; amaute a hihse ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa’n amau a honpe dia, thu ka honpiak thupiak tengteng a tung uah na hih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kuhkaltak leh hangsantak in om un. Lau kei unla, kihta sam kei un. Na kiang ua honpepa Toupa na Pathian uh ahi ngal a. A hon vuallel sak kei dia, pai leng a hon paisan kei hial ding,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mosi in Joshua a sam a, Israel mi tengteng mit muh in a kiang ah, “Hattak leh hangsantak in om in. Hiai mite toh a kiang ua a pi leh pute uh Toupa’n kichiam a piak a na chiamsa gam ah na lut ngeingei ding uhi, amaute na luahsak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na ma uh pipa Toupa ahi dia, na kiang ah a om zel dia, a hon vuallel sakkei dia, pai leng a hon paisan kei hial ding hi. Lau kenla, lunglel sam ken” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mosi in dan a gelh a, Toupa thukhun bawm zawng Levi tapa siampute leh Israel upate tengteng a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mosi in, amau thu a pia a, “Kum sagih kum, ngaihdam kum teng a bawkta Ankuangluina,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />mun a seh dia Israel mi tengteng Toupa na Pathian uh ma a hong kilat chiang un, hiai dan Israel tengteng zak in na sim ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mipite, numei leh pasal, na ta neu chikchikte uh, na ompih uh gamdang mite, amau a ngaihkhiak ua, a kisin ua, Toupa na Pathian uh laudan a siam ua, hiai danthu tengteng pilvangtak a a zuihtheihna ding uh leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a tate uh a theinailoute’n leng a zak ua, Jordan luikan a na valuah ding uh gam a na ten sungteng ua Toupa na Pathian uh laudansiam a kisin theihna ding un samkhawm in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Ngai in, na sih hun a hong naita; Joshua sam inla, Kihoupihna puanin ah va kihil in, amau thu ka pe ding hi” a chi hi. Huchi in Mosi leh Joshua a hoh ua, kihoupihna puanin ah a va kihil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa puanin ah meipi ding in a kilak a; meipi ding puanin kongpi lu tung ah ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi kiang ah, “Ngai in, na pi leh pute kiang ah na ihmu ding hi. Hiai mite a thou ding ua, a va tenna dingte uh lak ah huai gam pathiante lak ah a angkawm ding ua, a hon lehngatsan ding ua, ka thukhun a kiang ua ka khun a bohse ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in huai chiang in a tung uah ka heh dia, ka lehngatsan dia, ka kibuk mangsan dia, hihsiat in a om ding uh. Thil hoihlou leh mangbatna tampi a tung uah a tung ding hi. Huchi in huai ni’n, i Pathian uh i lak ua a omlouh ziak in hiai thil hoihlou i tung uah a hongtung ahi kei maw? a chi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian dangte lam nga a thil hoihlou a hih ding tengteng uh ziak in huai ni’n ka kibuk san ngeingei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huaiziak in, tuin ‘hiai la gelh inla, Israel suante sinsak inla, a kam uah koih in. Hiai la Israel suante kalhna a kei adia theihpihtu a hih theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A pi leh pute uh kiang a kichiam a ka chiam, nawitui leh khuaizu luang gam ah ka pi a, ne leh ta in a om ua, a tai ua, a hong thau hial chiang un pathian dangte lam a nga ding ua, a nna uh a sem ding ua, kei a hon hehsak ding ua, ka thukhun a bohse ding uh’.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, thil hoihlou leh mangbatna tampi a tung ua a hongtun chiang in, hiai la a khelhna uh theihpihtu ahi ding. A suante kam apan mangngilh theih ahi kei ding hi. Tuin ka kichiam gam a ka pilut ma him in leng a lunggel uh a kawi dan ka thei hi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in Mosi in, huai la, huai ni mahmah in a gelh a, Israel suante a sinsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nun tapa Joshua kiang ah hiai thupiak a pia hi. “Hattak leh hangsantak in om in. Israel suante kiang a ka kichiam bang in huai gam ah na pilut ding hi. Na kiang ah ka om ding,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Mosi in hiai danthute laibu a gelhkhit a mansa ahihvek nung in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Toupa thukhun bawm zawng Levite Mosi in thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Hiai dan bu la unla, noute kalh a theihpihtu hi din Toupa na Pathian uh thukhun bawm sik ah koih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na helhat dan uh leh na paupen dan uh ka thei hi. Ngai un, tua k’on dampih lai a bawn Toupa tung a hel na hi ua; ka sih nung ngial in houh bangchi phet in a thupizaw diam aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A bil ua zak a hiai thu ka gen a, noute kalh a theihpihtu dia lei leh van ka sap theihna din na nam ua intekpen tengteng leh na heutute uh hon samkhawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka sihnungin nakpitak in na kihihse ding ua, k’on thupiak lampi apan na pial ding uh chih ka thei kilkel hi. A tawp chiang ngial in houh thil hoihlou in a hon buak khum dia; na khut thilhih ua hihheh din Toupa mitmuh a thil hoihlou na hih ding ziak un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mosi in, Israel kikhawm khawm tengteng zak in hiai la thu a bul apan a tawppha in a genvek hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bil na doh un, vante aw, ka gen ding hi. Lei aw, ka kam a thu za in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vuahtui bang in ka thu a zu ding a, Daitui bang in ka thugen a tak ding. Loupa nou dipdip tung a vuah bang leh lounah tung a vuah phin bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa min ka phuan ding ziak in Thupina i Pathian pia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah suangpi ahi, A thilhih a dik kim sipsip hi. A omdan tengteng dan ahi. Pathian muanhuai, thulimlouhna neilou, diktat leh hoih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amau leh amau a kihihsia ua, a tate ahi kei uh, gensiat a lohna uh ahi, suan ginalou leh genhak ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihai leh pilloute aw, huchi in maw, Toupa na thuk ding uh? Nou honsuang, na pa uh ahi kei maw? A honbawl a, a hon ding kipsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nidanglai nite theigige inla, suan tampi kumte ngaihtuah dih. Na pa dong in, a hon kawkmuh ding, na upate’n leng a honhilh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tungnung Pen in namte gam a piaklai a, mihing tate a khenlai in namte gamgi Israel suante zah in a khung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa tantuan zaw a mite ahi ua; Jakob lah a goutan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gamdai gam ah a mu a, gamdai sia mau honhon ah, a kim ua omkhum in a kem a, A mit laivom bang in a kem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Muvanlai in a bu a a nou tokthou a, a nou tung ah kha a zap a, a khate a zak a, a tuah a, a kha a a puak bang in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gamdang pathian hilou in Toupa kia in a pi zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lei munsangte ah a tuangsak a, lou a thil tung a ne zel a; suangpi apan khuaizu a kikhoh khesak zel a, suangtak apan thau toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawng nawitui khal, belam nawitui, belamnou thau toh, Bashan uain na dawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh Jeshurun a hongthau a, a hong kipek a; na thau a, na sapha a, na maitai a; a bawlpa Pathian a lehngatsanta, hotdamna Suangpi a ngaineu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gamdang pathiante’n i Pathian mullitna a tokthou a, thil kihhuai in a hehsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian hilou, dawite kiang ah a theih ngeilouh uh pathiante kiang ah, a hong khonung om phing pathian thakte, na pi, na pute un a kihtak ngeilouh uh kiang ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang honsuang Suangpi na ngaisang kei, nang hon bawlpa Pathian na mangngilh lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huai Toupa’n a mu a, a mudah a, a tanu leh tapate’n a hih heh ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka bukmang san dia, a tawpna uh bang ahi dia chih ka en ding a chi. Suan thulimlou ginna neilou tate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian hilou thil in ka mullitna a tokthou ua; a thil ginalou un a hon hehsak uh; chi a genlouhte ka mullitsak dia, nam haite in ka hehsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka hehna a kuang a, gawtmun nuainung pen tan in a kang a, lei leh a thilpung a kang ding, tangte kingaknate mei in a kang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A tung uah siatna ka chiangkhawm dia, a tung uah thal ka khah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gilkial in a gongthak ding ua, meisa leh siatna in a kang mang ding ua, a tung uah gamsa hate ka sawl dia, leivui a gulte gu toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nungak, tangval, nawi nelai, lu a kelsam poute tanpha’n pawlam ah namsau in a si ding ua, sung lam ah launa in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ken, ka delhzak vek ding, mihing lak a amau theihgigena ka hihmang vek ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Melma thangpaihna laulou hileng, a melmate un theikhial in, i khut uh tawisang in a omta, huai teng Toupa hih ahi kei, a chi kha ding uhi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pilna neilou namte ahi ua, amau ah theihsiamna a omkei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw, pil le uh hiaite a theisiam ding ua, a tunung thu uh ngaihtuah ding hive un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bangchi’n khat in sang a delh dia, nih in sing a taikek sak ding ua, a Suangpi un amaute a khawngkhinta hi, Toupa’n amau a piakkhiak kei ngal leh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A suangpi uh lah i melmate mahmah theihdan in leng i Suangpi bang ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A grepgui uh Sodom grepgui ahi a, a loute uh Gomorrah loute ahi. A grepte uh sinkha grepte ahi uh, a gahbomte a kha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A uainte uh dragon gu leh gulgial gu khatak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hiai ka kholkhawm, ka goubawm a bilh bikbek ahi kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Phulak leh thuk zaw kei hih ding ahi, a siksan uh a teu hun chiang in; a siatna ni uh a hong naita, a tung ua thil hongtung dingte a hong tungpahta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Toupa’n a mite a vaihawm ding, a sikhate leng a lainat ding, a thilhihtheihna uh a bei chih leh kuamah sikha leh noplen a omkei, chih a muh chiang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Aman a pathiante uh koi ah, a muan suangpi uh koi ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />a kithoihna thau netute, a dawn thillat uain dawntute? Hong thou in nou hong panpih uhenla, nou hon humbittute hile uh a ke, a chi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kei, kei mahmah ka hihthei unla, pathian dang a omkei. Ka that a, ka hingsak a, ka liamsak a, ka damsak hi. Ka khut apan noute hon hunkhe thei kuamah a omkei uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Vanlam ah ka khut ka zak a, Keimah hinna lou in ka kichiam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ka namsau tat-hiam a, ka khut a vaihawmna ka let leh ka melmate tung ah phu ka la dia, kei hon hawte ka thuk ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ka thaltangte a sisan uah ka diah dia, ka namsau in sateng ka that bei dia; thahte leh salte sisan toh melmate tung a phulakna a kipan, a chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Aw, nou nam chihte aw, a mite toh kipak un; a sikhate sisan phuba a la ding hi. Amah doute tung ah phu a la ding, a gam leh a mite adin kilemna bukim a bawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Huchi in mipite zak in Mosi leh Nun tapa, Joshua in hiai la thu tengteng a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mosi in huai thu tengteng Israel mi tengteng kiang a a genkhit in, a kiang uah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua na kiang ua k’on thu theihsak ah na lungtang uh koih kip unla, hiai dan tengteng pilvang mahmah a zui din na tate uh thupia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Nou adin thil bangmahlou lel ahi kei a, na hinna uh ahi ngal a. Hiai thilhih in luah dia Jordan na va galkahna gam uah na damsawt ding uhi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Huai ni mah in Toupa’n Mosi a houpih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Moab gam a Jeriko zawn a Abarim tang dung a Nebo tang ah va hohtou inla, Israel suante luah dia ka piak Kanan gam va gal et in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Na unaupa Aron Hor tang a si a, a chipihte kiang a pi a hihtak mah bang in na kahtouh na tang ah na si dia, na chipihte kiang a pi na hita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Jin gamdai a Kadesh a Meribah tui a Israel suante lak a ka tung a na khelh ziak in leh Israel suante lak a n’on pahtawilouh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tua gam na va galmuh dia; himahleh Israel suante ka piak gam ah na lut kei ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiai vualzawlna in ahi, Pathian mi Mosi in a sih ma a Israel suante a vualzawlna:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sinai apan Toupa a hongpai a, Seir apan a kiang uah a thou khia a, Mi Siangthou sang sawm lak apan a hongpai; A khut taklam apan amau adin meikuang bang dan a om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi, a mite a it a, Mi Siangthou tengteng na khut ah a om uh. Na khebul ah a tu ua; na thute a zuichiat ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mosi in eite dan a honpia, Jakob mipite gouluah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jeshurun ah amah kumpipa ahi, mipite intekpen leh Israel chi tengteng a omkhawm lai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Reuben hing hen, silou in, a mite ahihleh tawm kei uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hiai Judah vualzawlna ahi. Toupa Judah aw ngaikhia inla, a mite kiang ah pilut in. A khut amah adin kiching henla, nang a melmate doupihpa hi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Levi tungthu ah, na Thummim leh na Urim, na Mi Siangthou kiang ah omsak in, Massah ah na ze-et a, Meribah tuite ah na dou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka nu leh ka pa ka theikei, chi in; a unaute leng a thei sam kei hi. Amah tate ngeileng a thei tuankei; na thu a pom ua, na thukhun a zui ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na vaihawmte Jakob a sinsak ding ua, Israelte, na dan. Na ma ah gimlim a koih ding ua, na maitam ah haltum thillat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A neihte vualzawl in, Toupa , a khut nasepte a na pom inla; amah doute kawng sat inla, amah hawte kawng toh, adin nawnlouhna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Benjamin tungthu ah zaw, Toupa deihtak zaw a kiang ah bit in a teng ding. Nitum in amah a khuh dia, a liangte kikal ah a teng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Joseph tungthu ah zaw, a gam Toupa vualzawl in om hen, van thil mantam daitui in, tui thuk mahmah nuai lam a tui in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nisa in a piansak gah manphate leh khapi in a omsak thil mantamte in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nidanglai tangte a thil deihhuaipente in, tangtawn tang a thil mantamte in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lei leh a tung a thil mantamte in, loubuk a ompa deihsakna in. Vualzawlna Joseph lu tung ah hongom hen, a unaute apan hihtuam a ompa lusip ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A thupina bawngtal piang masa thupina bang ahi a, a kite gam bawngtal kite bang ahi. Huai in namchih a si a, kawlmong tan in a si ding. Amaute Ephraim sang sawmte ahi ua, Manasseh sangte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zebulun tungthu ah, Kipak in, Zebulun, na vakkhiaknate ah, Issakar, na puaninte ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tang ah chichih a sam ding ua, huai ah diktatna kithoihnate a lan ding uh. Tuipi buchinna ne ding ahi ngal ua, piaunel a gou kiselte toh, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gad tungthu ah, Gad hihlianpa phat in om hen, humpinelkai bang in a teng a, a luzang in a ban a hamkek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah adin a hoihna pen a tel a, Dan pepa tantuan mun a amah a tut ziak in, intekpente toh a hoh a, Toupa vaihawmna dik leh Israelte kiang a vaihawmnate a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dan tungthu, Dan humpinelkai nou ahi a, Bashan apan a hong tawm ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Naphtali tungthu ah, Naphtali aw, deihsakna a lungkim, Toupa vualzawlna a tai, sim leh tum luah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Asher tungthu ah, Asher tate a vualzawl in om henla, a unaute lak ah tuitum henla; thau ah a khete diah hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na khedap sik leh dal ahi dia, na damsung ni bang in na hatna leng a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jeshurun Pathian nang hon panpih dia van a tuang, thupitak a van a tuang bang kua mahmah a omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tangtawn Pathian na kibukna ahi a, nuai lam ah a tangtawn ban a om, melmate a hon satmang dia, Hihmang in, a chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel bel galmuangtak in amah kia in a teng dia, Jakob tui leh buh leh uain gam ah a om ding, a vante’n leng daitui a kesak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na hampha hi, aw, Israel, nangmah bang a Toupa’n a hotdam mite kua a om a? Nang hon panpihpa phaw, na thupina namsau ahi! Na melmate nang ah a hong kipe ding ua, nang a munsangte uh na tuanchil ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Mosi Moab phaizang apan Jeriko zawn a Nebo tang, Pisgah tang vum ah a hohtou a; Toupa’n Gilead gam tengteng, Dan pha in a ensak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Naphtali leh Ephraim gam tengteng, Manasseh leh Judia gam tengteng, a tumlam tuipi pha in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sim gam leh tum khopi Jeriko phaizang, Zoar pha in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa’n a kiang ah, “Hiai gam ahi, Abraham, Isak leh Jakob kiang a, ‘Na suante ka pe ding,’ chi a kichiam a ka na chiam. Muh ahihleh k’on musak peuhmah a, himahleh huai ah na paikei ding,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa sikha Mosi Toupa thu bang in Moab gam ah a sita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Beth Peor zawn a Moab gam phaizang ah Toupa’n a vui a; himahleh tunitan in kuamah in a han a theikei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mosi a sih in kum za leh sawmnih a upa ahi; a mit a mial kei a, a tha leng a kiam tuankei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel suante’n Mosi Moab phaizang ah ni sawmthum a kah ua, Huchi in Mosi sun a a kah nite uh a hong beita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nun tapa Joshua pilna kha in a dim a; Mosi in a tung a, a khut a koih ziak in. Israel suante’n a thu a zui ua, Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in a hih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai nung in Israelte lak ah Mosi bang a Toupa’n kimaituah a a houpih zawlnei himhim a omta kei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chiamtehna leh thillamdang tengteng, Pharo leh a sikha tengteng kiang leh Aigupta gam tengteng a ensak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />khut hattak leh lauhuai pipi a Israel mi teng mitmuh a Mosi in a hih bang hih a omkei uhi.
  </para>
</usx>
